<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAK</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Etib bi Jon ji nwohngalahb tiingi no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Mbomannahb a nnoobo etib bi Jisos Kraist Mmon Esowo bi a. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Mahne mahne nnyehnamahr Aisaya nyono go ege a nwer ana Esowo tongo Mmon ewe re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“M bahke tumu ntiingetib ewame tv re á gbo-a mbang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">ba lennge mbang ka-a.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />“Nne noa, kpꞌrabe go elka emahng re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Tuungen mbang nyi Ntul bahke sehnge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">wahn lim tꞌtor.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ane noo bo jo lung-e re Jon, á je go elka emahng, song kehme ane tiingi re, “Gboon ndon go egahne abiafem, wahn bel ewohngalahb, eji Esowo lꞌtahm ka-n go egahne abiafem.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Ane kpee ba lene o nfam nyio nyi Judea, a ane kpee ba lene go Jeusalem jo lohngo je goji Jon, song fvvrv abiafem ebo, fere bel ewohngalahb go Jodan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Jon jo kake nsol nyi bo limi go anyar nnyam nyi bo kpo lung re ekamel, fere jo gbaange egbaange ngunyam go ebun. Á jo li agohrobi, fere jo yab akehng ekon.<verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Á kehm kehme ane tiingi re, “Nne no kpꞌbake go, á li njꞌjoka nne sehnge me. Jol me, n tohkem fꞌfuumu re, me n kehme go ndi fannge alehke akpaketa enye. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Eltum ename li re, me n jo wohng-n alahb maka maka. Ye ji kpꞌbake, bahk-n wohngo alahb go Etingi Etohko.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 2:4</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ewohngalahb ji Jisos bele no, a elgaare ni nnehm gar-e no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ngare nyio Jisos lohngo go Nasaret ji Galili, ba go Jodan. Jon kehm-e wohngo alahb.<verse eid="MRK 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Jisos lohngo kan go alahb me, á kehm nyehne ejahbetul Esowo kpꞌlennge. Etohko ji Esowo kehm lohngo go elfoongo ni ebbehl, badde ba jol a ne. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Á kehm wuku ellum go ejahbetul Esowo ni bungu re, “Wo wo li akor-m mmon ewame no kpo kor-m sꞌsehng.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 9:7</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Tvtv ona etohko ji Esowo kehm soro rod-e tahm a ne go elka emahng. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Á kange elka emahng nio nfung atahl abal. Owo nnehm gar-e no, re á yel go abiafem. Enyam bi kpo jol emahng jolo ona fvfo. Owo enjel nyi Esowo kehm lohngo ba kak-e ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:43; Hib 1:14</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lungu abasahre nsahre, ane na ani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ngare nyio, Jon, bo m-e kak go ngbekobo. Jisos kehm tahme song rehng go Galili, song tiingi nnoobo etib bi Esowo. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Á jo bungu re, “Etingitingi, ngare ebrehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:4</char></note> Etul bi Esowo ebkabbe. Gboon ndon go egahne abiafem, wahn taame tv nnoobo etib bi Esowo!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Eji Jisos jo jen egbuk eto ji Galili, á nyehne abasahre nsahre, ane na abal, Saimon, a Andru ji mmonannyehn Saimon, bo jo kake erim go eto. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Tahmen toon-m wahn! M bahk-n limi, ń nehm kpe bim nsahre, ḿ bahke fere jo bim ane.”<verse eid="MRK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Bo kehm soro yake arim ebo, tahm toono Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Á kehm jene mmokidi, song kpiri Jems, a Jon ba jolo abon Sibidi. Bo woomo egbang, jo baade arim ebo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Jisos kehm mahke bo. Bo kehm soro tahm nde ebo, a alokeltum ebe sa go egbang, tahm toono Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne no bele ebi etohko go ege atahng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Bo kehm song rehng go ejahbe ji bo jo lung re Kapenium. Efung Esabat Jisos kehm ba yel ekpꞌkpa ero kehm kehme eltibi. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ane ba wuk-e no, kpo bo esi sehng tib go mbang nyi á jo tib. Á jolem ana atꞌtibi baka gana ba atahm. Á jo tibi area, ana nne no kpi nsahm.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Nne no bele ebi etohko go ege atahng kehm soro lohng, ba yel ekpꞌkpa ero jio. <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />Á kehm rabe tong Jisos re, “Jisos ji Nasaret, a ba jen ko go egahre? A ba re wo ba ranng-ra? N kpꞌkahne elkohn nne no a li no. A li mbarebara nne no Esowo. Ebi ajehng ajehng wa wobem go ega eltim. A lohng goji Esowo ba.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Jisos kehm rabe tong ebi etohko jio re, “Rahke ewok, wo lohng nne noa!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ebi etohko jio limi nne noo, á soro gbo ngbabohngo, fere rabe tiim, kehm soro lohng nne noo.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ane kpee ba jolo o, kpo bo esi area. Bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Jen ji jo jol ana? Nkpokosi anyi a? A eltibi ni nfenfe ni! Nne noa kpi nsahm nyi abi atohko kpo wuk-e, á lꞌbung a bo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Elgahm ni Jisos kehm yeere na yeere go nfam nyio nyi Galili kpee.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi ane gbalee, bo nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Jisos, Jems, a Jon, bo kehm lohngo go ekpꞌkpa ero jio asongo go etahk ji Pita a Andru lene no. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Saimon, nnyehn nkal ewe noongo edilnong, jo yam arumbum. Jisos rehnge kan a me, bo kehm-e tongo bada nnenkal noo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Á kehm jeere kohl-e, song jabb-e go ebo, tab-e yiimi. Á soro nob arumbum nyao. Nnenkal noo kehm tahme fvfo, kehme bo loko.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Elgung ba kan a me, ngare nyi njul ma lahm, ane kehm koko aneb ayam kpee, a aneb abi atohko ba goji Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ane kpee ba jolo ejahbe jio kehm ba nyo na nyo go mbutahk. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Jisos limi aneb ayam gbalee, bo nob elkohn eyam abehng abehng, fere kam ane gbalee abi atohko. Á taamem re, abi atohko nyao bung ejumjum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 16:17-18</char></note> Tibre bo jo kꞌkahn nne no Jisos li no.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu alum Esowo go Galili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Etoono efung behko Jisos kehm fungu atv atv tahm song rehng go edi ji li soom, song kak ero.<verse eid="MRK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Saimon, a atem bako go kehm tahme, kehm-e elsebe. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Eji bo nyehn-e no, bo kehm-e tongo re, “Nsoo, ane kpee kp-a sebe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Wahr tahmen go abon ajahbe bako. M bahke tob bung alum Esowo tong bo. Tibre nya nya wahng ka m ba no.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Á kehm mehle, kehme elyannge go Galili, jo bung alum Esowo go ntahk ero, fere kam ane abi atohko yehke go bo a ntim.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nne abili, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Efung abehng nne abili kehm bake goji Jisos, ba gbo jamm-e alahng, kehm-e gboongo re, “Lꞌfere kor-a, lim-m, me n nob.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jisos, ndon kehm-e fili. Á kehm tanne ebo, koor-e, kehm-e tongo re, “Kor-m kor, wobnob.”<verse eid="MRK 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Tvtv o nnenlum noo kehm soro nob abili nyao.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Jisos kehm-e rehke tꞌtahne, fere tong-e re á song. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Á kehm-e tongo re, “Wuungu atung, n kp-a tongo re, wo kꞌtiki tong nne awohng awohng jia ana! Song goji nlimajom, á feed-a, wo song lim njom nyi Moses tibi no, eji ane lꞌkahn re wobnob.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Nne noo kehm tahme, kehm kehme eltiingi nkpokosi nyi m-e lim, tong ane edi ajehng ajehng. Á tooro area, kehn jol Jisos kꞌkpe ma lohng go nfam gbul gbul gbuul. Á jo fere jen eje adi nya li soom. Ane jo kpe lohng edi ajehng ajehng, song kpir-e.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi mbanne, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Kange kan abon afung ntiil, Jisos kehm feere ba ga Kapenium. Eka kehm yeere na yeere re, Jisos noa etahk. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ane kehm bake ba nyo, jol eyake ajehng ajehng kpeem jol go mbutahk ji nne bahke sehnge yel ekpꞌkpa. Jisos kehm kehme bo nnoobo etib bio tiingi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ellong ane bako kehm kpe ba. Ane ani woomo go bo ellong o, ba solo mbanne, jo ba a ne goji Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Bo kahnem mbang nyi bo bahke sehnge a ne rehng goji Jisos, tibre ane ruru sehng. Bo kehm lahme elbultahk, kanne alehke go edilnong, kehm kehme eltahre, tete nne eyam noo song rehng edi ji Jisos jehk no.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Eji Jisos nyehne ana bo taame no tv-e, á kehm bungu tong mbanne nyio re, “Abiafem enya, me n tahm ka-a.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Atꞌtibi ba atahm bandiki ba ji o, kehm kehme eltiri go bo a ntim re, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Jen ji wahnge á ma daange Esowo, fere bung elkohn ellum ana nia? Nne awo bahke ma tahm ka nne go ege abiafem? Esowo ntahngtahng bi bahke ma tahm ka nne go ege abiafem.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Tvtv o Jisos kehm soro kahn ntir atahng abo, kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń tiri ntir ana nyia? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Jen ji ga riidi, n lꞌtong mbanne nyio re, ‘Abiafem enya, me n tahm ka-a,’ afi n lꞌtong-e re, ‘Mehl, wo rod edilnong eja, tahm jen?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />M bahke lennge fvfo tib-n re, Mmon no nne kpi nsahm go njini nyia, nyi á bahke ma tahm ka nne go ege abiafem.”<verse eid="MRK 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />Owo wahnge Jisos kehm tongo mbanne nyio re, “Mehl, wo rod edilnong eja, song kehnge!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Bo kehm kehme elseenge. Nne eyam noo soro mehl tvtv, rod edilnong eje tahm.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:12">Kehm kpoko bo esi, bo ane kpee. Bo kehme Esowo tehk re, “Elkohn ana nia, e ka nyehn a nyehn!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lungu Livai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Jisos kehm kpe lohng tahm go eto ji Galili. Ane kpee kehm bake go ege. Á kehm kehme bo tib. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Eji á kpꞌsehnge egbuk eto jio, á kehm nyehne Livai, mmon no Alfeus, jehk go ege edi eltum, kpi akpohko etak ko. Jisos kehm bungu tong-e re, “Tahm toon-m me!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:14">Livai kehm mehle fvfo toon-e.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Eji Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe jo li nsol go etahk Livai, abakokatak, a aneb abiafem gbalee tob jolo o fvfo, jo li nsol. Tibre ane gbalee ba jo toon-e.<verse eid="MRK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Eji ellong atꞌtibi ba atahm, ba bo jo lung bo re Farisis nyehne Jisos kpꞌlehke nsol a abakokatak, a aneb abiafem, bo kehm bahbe abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Jen ji wahnge á kpo li nsol a abakokatak, a aneb abiafem?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Jisos wuku kan bo, á kehm faange re, “Ane ba li nob nob kpehme seb nlimakahm, sehngem bao ba kpꞌyame ba kpo seb nlimakahm. M baam re me m ba lung anobonobo ane, m ba re me m ba lung aneb abiafem.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bada njal abade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-15">Mat 9:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-35">Luk 5:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Efung abehng abatꞌtoono Jon, a ba Farisi jo bade elbo njal. Bo kehm bake goji Jisos, ba bahb-e re, “Jen ji wahnge abatꞌtoono Jon, a abatꞌtoono Farisis kpo bade elbo njal, abatꞌtoono eba kil jo tob bade elbo ano?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Nꞌnob re ane ba bo ma tiingi bo elkak elbal, bo ji njala? Eji nfono elkak kpeke li na, bo nehm ma bade elbo njal. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ngare kpꞌbake nyi bo bahke koko nfono elkak tahm a ne. Ngare nyio lꞌrehng, owo bo bahke kehme elbo njal bade.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltibi ni mahne mahne lꞌli, eltibi ni Jisos lꞌli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:16-17">Mat 9:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:36-39">Luk 5:36-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Nnene limm, no bahke koko mmojang mbomo no nfenfe song baade nkꞌkula mbomo. Á lꞌlim ano, mmojang mbomo no nfenfe nehm yiimi. Nkꞌkula mbomo mio bahke kpe kv na edi jio budu sehnge ana wuku wuku. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Nnene limm, no bahke yaange amahm ma kpꞌfahle, kak go nkꞌkohko eyahbe. Á lꞌlim ano, eyahbe jio bahke bahnge na, amahm sale. Nobo re nne ko amahm ma kpꞌfahle, yaange kak go eyahbe nfenfe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 7:6</char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bade efung Esabat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Efung Esabat Jisos jo jene go emahng ji bo ma bahm nkohl. Eji abatꞌtoono ebe jo toon-e, bo kehm kehme amohk nkohl monngo tv go arahn.<verse eid="MRK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bab Farisi kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Jen ji wahnge abatꞌtoono eba kpꞌlimi ejum ji ki fuumu re nne lim efung Esabat?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Wahn ka tiki lung bade ana Devid limi noa, eji nfem gbo tub-ea, á song seb nsol alehke lia, ye, a ane ebea? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Á yele ekpꞌkpa Esowo, song li abred nya bo limi bum go esamahr Esowo. Jia ana limi ngare nyi Abiatar jolo ntubesi abalimajom. Ntahm enyahre li re, abalimajom ba ba fuumu re bo jo li abred nyao. Devid li abred nyao, fere faake erik ka ane ebe, bo tob li.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Esowo limi efung Esabat ka nne. Á limem nne ka efung Esabat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:5; Kol 2:16-17; Gal 4:10-11</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Mmon no nne tob li nfono Esabat.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Nne no ebo ebe lohngo no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Jisos kehm kpe feere go etahk ero. Nne jolo o, no ebo ebe lohngo no. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ane ba jolo o jo kpuru Jisos, joare á bahke limi nne noo, á nob efung Esabat. Tibre bo jo sebe ejum ji bo bahke kake Jisos ebi.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Jisos kehm bungu tong nne no ebo ebe ma lohng re, “Mehl, wo jeere ba!” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Jisos kehm bahbe ane bako re, “Ejum aji atahm enyahre bungu re nne jo lim efung Esabat? Á jo kak nne eboa, afi á jo rannge na? Á tahre elkpin nnea, afi á rannge elkpin nne?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Jol ejumjum bo we faangem.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Jisos, atahng kehm-e rake, eji á mehle no jang. Ndon kehm-e fere fili bada bo. Tibre bo bele etahnsi. Á kehm tongo nne noo re, “Tanne ebo eba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:5">Á kehm tanne ebo ebe, lohko nob tvtv. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bab Farisi kehm lohngo ekpꞌkpa ero jio o, kehm song kpiri alokeltum ntul a Herod. Bo kehm toobo ana bo bahke limi, kehm wulu Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ellong ane ba jolo go nkpe eto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jisos kehm tahme eje, a abatꞌtoono ebe go eto ji Galili. Ellong ane tvv tꞌtoono bo. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Ane bao lohngo go Galili, Judea, Jeusalem, a Idume, go egbuk jehko ji Jodan, fere lohng go abon ajahbe ba li sennge Taya abola Saidon kak. Ellong ane gbalee ba goji Jisos, tibre bobwuk ana á kpꞌlimi. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Jisos kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re bo toobo egbang bum-e, eji ane lꞌki-e fahd kak. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Tibre á limi ane gbalee, bo nob ayam ebo. Owo wahnge aneb ayam bao kpee jo temme atemtem re bo song koor-e ebo.<verse eid="MRK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Abi atohko lꞌnyehn Jisos, bo jo gbꞌgbo jamm-e alahng, fere jo rabe tiim re, “Wo wo li Mmon no Esowo!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 2:19</char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Jisos kehm rehke abi atohko nyao tꞌtahne re, bo kꞌtooro tong ane elkohn nne no ye li no.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yehke ewubu ane abal, bo jo toon-e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Jisos kehm tahme go ewong ajehng, song lung ane bao ba á kpꞌsebe. Bo kehm bake. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Á kehm yehke ewubu ane abal, fere tong bo re, “M ma-n yehke re wahn jol a name. M bahk-n tumu re wahn song bung alum Esowo. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Fvfo ḿ bahke bele nsahm nyi ḿ bahke jo kam abi atohko.” <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />A wo li ewubu ane abal ba á yehke no, Saimon ji Jisos ka-e mbing nyehko re Pita, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jems, a Jon, bo jolo abon ba Sibidi. Jisos ka bo abing nyako re Boanerges ji lohngo re, “abon ba li ana ndan”, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andru, Filip, Batolomi, Matiu, Tomos, Jems ji mmon no Alfeus, Tadeus, Saimon ji jo seb re ejahbe eje lohng go elwo ni aneb Rom, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />go Judas Iskariot ji gungu Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos abola ntul a nnehm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe, bo kehm feere kehnge go etahk. Ellong ane kehm kame na kam song rur. Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe belem eyake ji bo bahke lehke nsol. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ane ebe wuku kan a me, bo kehm bake re bo ba ko-e tahm a ne. Tibre bo jo bungu re, “Yebgbo esahl!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Atꞌtibi ba atahm bandiki ba lohngo go Jeusalem ba, kehm bungu re, “Á kpi etohko ji nnehm go ege eltim. Ntul a nnehm wo ka-e nsahm nyio re á jo kam ane abi atohko yehke.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Jisos kehm lungu ane bao tv elne, kehm tuubu ngaane tong bo re, “Nnehm bahke ma kam elne renan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ejahbe lꞌyab, jol ebo ebo, ejahbe jio bahke tane. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Nnahb lꞌyab, jol ebo ebo, nnahb nyio bahke tane. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Eblehm lꞌkehme elnoko atemtem, ejahbe ebo lꞌyab, bahke tane. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Nnene limm, no bahke ma wa mbutahk yel go etahk etahntahn nne, song kpu nsol enye kpee, sehngem re no, á tohko gbo mbang gba etahntahn nne noo alehke, kehm ma yel ege ekpꞌkpa, song seb ajehng ajehng ji kor-e no rod.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Ane bahke ma bel eltahmeka kpee go bo abiafem, a elsuku ni bo kpo su Esowo, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />wo, nne awohng awohng no lꞌfere lim abiafem, su Etingi Etohko, á nehm tiki bel eltahmeka go njinanjini. Abiafem nyao we nehm tiki laade go njinanjini.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 16:9</char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Jisos bungu jia, tibre ane tvv jo tongo re, “Á kpi ebi etohko.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnyehn Jisos, a abonanyehn Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nnyehn Jisos, a abonanyehn Jisos kehm bake. Bo yiimi go elatahk, tum re bo lung-e. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ellong ane tvv ji sennge Jisos kak. Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Nyehnee, nne, a abonane ebba yiimi go elatahk kp-a sebe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Nne awo li li nnee? Ane aba li li abonanee?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Á kehm tabe esamahr wahre, jang ane kpee ba ji senng-e kak, kehm bungu re, “Nyehnen, a wo li babnnee, a abonanee. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌlim ji Esowo kpꞌsebe re á lim, ye wo li mmonannee, a nnee.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada mbahmgbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Jisos kehm kpe tahm go eto ji Galili song tib ane. Ellong ane ni ba yiimi senng-e kak, gbale sehng. Owo á kehm song yel go egbang bi woomo go alahb, ellong ane jol ga nkpe egbuk.<verse eid="MRK 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Á jo ko ngaane, tib bo nsol tvv. A wo li eltibi ene ni á tibi bo re, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Wuungen atung! Nne jolo gona, no tahme re á song wohngo amohk nti enye. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Eji á tahme no re á song wohngo amohk nti go ege egbe, nyandiki gbo noongo go mbang. Nruk ba suudu kpee mele.<verse eid="MRK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />“Nyandiki gbo noongo go ndi nyi li atal atal. Abon ndi jolo ntiil. Amohk nti nyao gulu elmahnge. Tibre edi jio, ndi gbalem. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Njul nyaare kan a me, akohdo nti nyao wuudu, fere kpo. Tibre alohk jolem.<verse eid="MRK 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />“Nyandiki gbo kuumu elkob akpiri. Akpiri nyao gbale na, bulu akohdo nti nyao, kabem.<verse eid="MRK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />“Amohk nti nyako gbo noongo go nnooba ndi, kehm mahnge, fere gbal arahn, kab. Atasok nyandiki jo jolo eltahl a nkab ewubu eltahl a nkab ewubu, atasok nyandiki nkab atahl ara ara, atasok nyandiki nkab atahl alon alon.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Wuungen atung! Nne no kpi atung, nong á wuk!”<figure style="fig" alt="A man sowing seeds" file="lb00094c.tif" size="col" loc="Mak 4:9" ref="4:9">Nne no song saade amohk nti</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ji wahng ka Jisos jo tꞌtuubu ngaane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Eji Jisos jolo ntahngtahng, egom jindiki, a abatꞌtoono ebe kehm song ji senng-e kak, kehm-e bahbe bada ngaane enye. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Wahn, boblennge nsol nyi li bade etul bi Esowo ka-n, nyi Esowo behre no. Ngare anyehng anyehng egom jehko jo wuku ngaane nyi nyi.<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />“ ‘Re bo seenge na seenge seenge, jol bo nehm tiki nyehn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Re bo wuk na wuk wuk kak atung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">jol bo nehm tiki kahn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">eji bo lꞌkꞌgbo ndon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">feere goji Esowo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">fere bel eltahmeka.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:40; 2 Kor 4:4</char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lennge elgan ni li bada mbahmgbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Elgan nia wahn lenngema? Bahke limi renan, ń kehm kahne ngaane nyehko nyi m bahke kpe tuubu?<verse eid="MRK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />“Mbahmgbe noo tahme song wohngo alum Esowo.<verse eid="MRK 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />“Ane bandiki li ana amohk nti nya gbo noongo go mbang. Bo lꞌwuk alum Esowo, nnehm soro ba tvtv, ba yehke etib bio go bo a ntim.<verse eid="MRK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />“Ane bandiki li ana amohk nti nya gbo noongo go ndi nyi li atal atal. Bo lꞌwuk alum Esowo, bo ko tvtv a eyebatahng. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Nehm yel rahbe go bo a ntim, lim alohk. Jol nehm tohko kꞌkang, erem lꞌba, a ntong go alum Esowo nya bo wuku no, bo soro gbo tvtv.<verse eid="MRK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />“Ane bandiki li ana amohk nti nya fooro gbo go elkob akpiri. Bao ba li ane ba kpo wuk etib bio o. <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Gana, nsol nyi njini nyia kpi bo gbiingi go bo a ntim. Ekor akpohko kpꞌnehme bo. Bo fere jo nok, eji bo lꞌbel ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo ki kpi. Nsol nyia kpee bahke rake yel go bo a ntim, bulu alum Esowo tv. Akab nehm kab.<verse eid="MRK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />“Ane bako li ana amohk nti nya bo wohngo go nnooba ndi. Bo lꞌwuk alum Esowo ko, bo fere kab akab, egom jindiki eltahl a nkab ewubu eltahl a nkab ewubu, egom jindiki nkab atahl ara ara, egom jindiki nkab atahl alon alon.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etꞌrekahng ji bo konngo ejeere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Jisos kehm kpe soro asi re, “Nne ebkꞌko etꞌrekahng ba a jia, ba nyaala, fere rod ejeere konnga, afi á bum go nla ekpꞌkuru? Á kpo rod kunu go edi ji li gbuul. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ajehng ajehng ji bo behre no, bo bahke koko ba edi ji li gbuul. Ajehng ajehng ji bo bulu no, bo bahke tiki lennge. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Wuungen atung! Nne no kpi atung, nong, á wuk!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Fvfo, á kehm bungu tong bo re, “Kunen ekpu go ajehng ajehng ji ń kpo wuk. Mbang nyꞌnehm nyi ń kpo lam ane bako, nyꞌnehm nyi Esowo bahke tob lam-n. Elam ji Esowo bahke gbale sehng, fere sꞌsab. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Nne no kpi no, Esowo bahk-e kpe budu na. Nne no kpi ntiil, Esowo bahk-e gohro taare na, no á kpi no.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade amohk nti nya gbale antahng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Etul bi Esowo li ana nne no song wohngo amohk nti go ege egbe. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Á jo kono elnoongo lal ngare atv, fere nyahme efungfu. Amohk nti nyao mahng, fere gbal. Á kahnem ana limi lim. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ndi nyi kpo lim antahng re nsol mahng, fere gbal, kab akab. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ngare nyi nti nyio ma kab, nne noo bahke koko ebgbagodo, song bong. Tibre ngare elbongo ebrehng.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bada mmohk asia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Jisos kehm bahbe re, “E bahke bungu renan bade ana etul bi Esowo li no? Elgan ani e bahke koko lennge? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Li ana mmohk asia nyi sahb sꞌse go njini nyia sehnge mmohk eti anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Nne kehm rodo bahm go ndi. Kange kan a me, kehm gbale sehnge elrahnti anehng anehng, jamme agburu abꞌbo, nruk ba si ntahk.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Jisos jo bungu alum enye gbalee go ngaane ana elgan nia. Á jo bungu, eji bo lꞌmal elwuku. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Á jo tiki bung a bo go ngaane. Á lꞌjol ntahngtahng, a abatꞌtoono ebe, á jo lennge ajehng ajehng tong bo.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu tong nfeb, a ebuku naange</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Efung bꞌnehm ona, ngare elgung, Jisos kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Wahr siiren eto jia, rehng go egbuk jehko.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bo kehm yake ellong ane bao. Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm tahme yel egbang. Ngare nyio Jisos ebyel. Agbang nyako tob jolo o fvfo. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Nfeb nyi kpꞌtahne kehm bake. Ebuku kehm kehme ellimi. Alahb kehm jo kim, yel egbang, ba elruru.<verse eid="MRK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Jisos noongo go nnahb egbang jo lal. Á kunu esi go etisi. Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e nyahme re, “Ntꞌtibi, wa nehme luba, wahr ga yahke tano?!”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Jisos kehm mehle yiimi, kehm bungu tꞌtahne, tong nfeb re, “Rahke!” Á kehm fere tong ebuku re, “Goomo!” Nfeb nyio kehm rahke. Edi kehm naange soom.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Jisos kehm fere bung tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Jen ji ń kpꞌfahle ana? Jen ji wahng ka ń kil-m elbumu go etingitingi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Tibre bo fahle sehng. Bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Anv, elkohn nne awo anae, no kpo bung tong nfeb, a ebuku, wuk-e?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nne no bele ebi etohko, á nob</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Bo kehm rehnge go egbuk eto jehko go ejang bi Gerasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jisos lohngo kan go egbuk, á kehm soro wane nne no lohng go edi ji alam akvne jolo no. Nne noo ona bele ebi etohko go ege atahng. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Á lene go alahm akvne. Nnene we kpeem ma kak agbekobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Nkpel tvv bo jo kak-e agbekobo. Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi bo gba-e no, á tohng nya abo kiimi, fere ruumu nya akpade kiimi. Nne ne jolem, no jo mal gon-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 19:16</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Atv a njul á jo yannge go alahm akvne, a awong, jo rabe tiim, fere jo rod atal, jo kadde elne, yehke alok.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Á jolo fee, eji á nyehne Jisos. Á kehm beke ba gbo jamme Jisos alahng, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />kehm rabe tiim re, “Jisos ji Mmon no Esowo bi li go ero, a ba jen go egame? Tib go esi ji Esowo m ma-a gboongo re, wo ki-m kak erem!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Á bungu jia, tib eji Jisos m-e tohko tong re, “Ebi etohko lohng-e!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Jisos kehm bahbe ebi etohko jio re, “Mbing enya mee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Á kehm faange re, “Mbing enyame li re ‘Egomegom’. Tibre e li go egom.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Á kehm soro gboongo Jisos re, á kꞌkam bo yehke go ejahbe jio. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ellong akuk jolo o kpidi kpidi, jo li nsol go ewong. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Abi atohko nyao kehm kehme Jisos gboongo re, á lub tum bo, bo song yel akuk nyao go atahng.<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Jisos kehm taame. Abi atohko nyao kehm soro yake nne noo abo, tahm song yel akuk nyao go atahng. Bo kehm beke song fooro agbunggbung gbo yel go alahb tan. Kpee ellong akuk nio o jolo akuk atahltahl nkpel elon (2,000).<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Ane ba jo baabe akuk nyao, be ebo tahm, song tiingi go etahk, a abon ajahbe bako fvfo. Ane bao kehm lohngo re bo song nyehn ji ma lim. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Bo kehm bake goji Jisos, ba nyehn nne no bele ellong abi atohko go ege atahng. Á jehk eje sange sange, fere kak nsol go ngubjing. Bo kehm kehme elfahle. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ane ba nyehne no, kehm song tong ane bako ji ma lim nne no bele abi atohko, a ji ma lim akuk. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Bo kehm tongo Jisos re, á tahm ejahbe jio.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:40</char></note><verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Eji Jisos yele egbang, nne no bele abi atohko kehm jo gboong-e re, “Nong, me n toon-a, wahr tahm!”<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Jisos taamem, á tong-e re, “Feere song goji ane eba, wo song tong bo ana ji Ntul ma lim ka-a, ana a ma fili Esowo ndon.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Nne noo kehm tahme jo yannge go ejahbe na ebwubu bi bo jo lung re Dekapolis, jo tooro ji Jisos ma lim ka-e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:20">Ane bao kpee ba wuku no, kpo bo esi area.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmon a Jairus abola nnenkal no kooro Jisos ebo go ege a nsubu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Jisos kehm yele egbang, feere egbuk eto jehko. Owo ane kame no ba rur senng-e kak. Á jolo kpidi kpidi go nkpe eto.<verse eid="MRK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ntubesi awohng go ellong atubesi ba etahk ero, no bo jo lung-e re Jairus kehm bake. Á nyehne kan Jisos, á kehm gboko jamm-e alahng go alata, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />kehm-e gboongo gbalee re, “Mmon ewame yahke kpo, titi, ba wo ba kun-e ebo go esi, eji á lꞌnob, fere bel elkpin.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Jisos kehm soro tahm toono Jairus. Ellong ane tvv jo tob toono bo go njahm. Bo jo gbulu na gbul atemtem mbang mbang.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Nnenkal awohng jolo o, no alung sa-e nnahb ewubu a nnya ebal. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Á jo nyehne erem sehng, eji abalimakahm tvv jo lim-e akahm. Á rannge akpohko enye kpee re á nob eyam bio, eyam jo kpe-e nyede na. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Á wuku bada Jisos. Owo á kehm jene a ellong ane ba jo toono Jisos go njahm, ba kooro nsubu enye. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Tibre nnenkal noo bungu go ege eltim re, “N lꞌlub koor-e na kooro go ege a nsubu, m bahke nobo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Á kehm soro kooro nsubu enye. Alung eme soro mal. Á kehm soro kahn tvtv re, yeblohko nob eyam ebe.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Tvtv o Jisos kehm soro kahn re, nsahm m-e tele lohng. Á kehm keebe seenge ellong ane bao, kehm bahbe re, “Nne awo ma-m kooro go egama nsubu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm faange re, “A kpꞌnyehne re, ane ebrur sehng, gana a kpꞌbahbe re, nne awo ma-m kooro!”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Tvtv o Jisos kpi njange njange re á nyehn nne no koor-e no. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Nnenkal noo kehm soro kahn ji ma lim go ege a ngubjing, kehm bake goji Jisos a elfahle, a ekahme akahb, ba gbo jamm-e alahng, kehm-e soro tong etingitingi kpee.<verse eid="MRK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Jisos kehm tongo re, “Nnenkal, eltaame ena ebwahng ka wobnob. Song go eyebatahng! Woblohko nob eyam eba.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Eji Jisos jo bung jia, ane bandiki kehm soro lohng go etahk ntubesi etahk ero noo, kehm ba tong-e re, “Mmon ewa ebkpo. Jen ji wahng ka a kpꞌkpeke gbiingi nsoo?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Jisos wuungem atung a jio ji bo bungu no. Á kehm tongo ntubesi no re, “Ka fahl, taame na taame!”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Jisos taamem re, nnene toon-e, sehngem Pita, Jems a Jon ji mmonannyehn Jems, bo ba, á taame re bo toon-e. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bo kehm soro rehng etahk ntubesi noo. Jisos kehm nyehne egom jehko ji kpꞌlingi, fere nyehn bako ba kpꞌkake agohrobi, fere jo jokko na jokko edi. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Á kehm maade yel go ekpꞌkpa, song tong bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌlimi ana? Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌlꞌling? Mmon noa ka kpo. Á kpꞌlale na.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Bo kehm-e kehme elwolo. Á kehm nyame bo re, bo lohng elatahk. Owo á kehm lungu nde mmon, fere lung nnyehn mmon, a abatꞌtoono ebe, ane ara ba toon-e no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Bo kehm yele ekpꞌkpa jio ji mmon noo noongo no. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Jisos song jabbe mmon noo go ebo, kehm bungu tong-e re, “Talita kumi,” ji lohngo re, “Mmon ewame, n tong-a re, wo mehl yiimi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Á kehm soro mehl tvtv, soro kehme eljene yannge. Ngare nyi nkpokosi nyio limi no, yebkang ewubu a nnya ebal. Kpo bo esi area. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Jisos kehm bungu tꞌtahne re, bo kꞌtong nnene. Á kehm soro bung re, “Kaan ye nsol alehke, á li!”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ana aneb Nasaret tene Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Jisos kehm tahme edi jio, song rehng go ege ejahbe, a abatꞌtoono ebe. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Efung Esabat á kehm song tib go ekpꞌkpa ero. Ane gbalee jolo o. Eji bo wuk-e no, kpo bo esi area. Bo kehm bahbe re, “Gan wo á bele nyaa? Á limi renan, kehm bele elkahne ana nia?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:15; Elt 4:13</char></note> Á kpo lim renan, kehm limi akpokosi nyaa! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ye sang li ekapentaa, ji li mmon a Meria? Ye sang li mmonannyehn a Jems, Joses, Jud a Saimona? Abonanyehn ba nkal sang lene aa?” Ano wo wahnge bo kehm-e tene.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Nnyehnamahr Esowo, bo kpo kak-e edi ajehng ajehng, sehngem re nnahb enye, ejahbe eje, a etahk eje ji kil jo kak-e.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Á maam lim nkpokosi anyehng anyehng o, sehngem re abon amohk ane ntiil ba jo yam ba á kunu bo ebo, bo nob. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Jisos, kpo-e esi area, eji ejahbe eje ki taame.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Á kehm kehme elyannge go abon ajahbe ba jolo sennge ona, kehme bo tib.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos tumu abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Jisos kehm lungu abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal tv edi ajehng, kehm tumu bo ane abal abal. Á ka bo nsahm re bo kam ane abi atohko yehke. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Á bungu tong bo re, “Kana fili ejum ajehng ajehng, sehngem ntifilibo nyi nyi ḿ bahke fili. Kana fili nsol alehke! Kana fili abam! Kana kak akpohko go egahne abam! <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Kaken akpaketa! Kana fili mbomo ebal ebal!” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Á kpe tong bo re, “Ń lꞌje, jolen a ane bao ba tong-n no re wahn kang go bo a ntahk. Kana yaange etahk jimongo tete ń tahm ejahbe jio. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Ń lꞌfere je ejahbe ji ane lꞌki-n vvrv, kꞌfere wuung-n atung, lohngen ejahbe jio o, wahn kum akpade. Jia bahke jolo ana elliingi ka bo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Bo kehm lohngo song bung alum Esowo re, ane gbo ndon go bo abiafem. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bo kame ane abi atohko yehke gbalee, fere jo taame aneb ayam akehng, bo jo nob.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jon ji nwohngalahb kpo no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ntul a Herod kehm wuku bada nsol nyia kpee. Tibre elgahm ni Jisos ebyeere gbalee. Ane bandiki jo bungu re, “Jon ji nwohngalahb ebnyahme go elkv, fere jol go elkpin. Owo wahng ka nne noo kpi elkohn nsahm ana nyio, fere kpꞌlimi akpokosi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ane bandiki jo fere bung re, “Elaija wo a.” Ane bandiki jo bungu re, “Nnyehnamahr wo, ana ajꞌjok anyehnamahr Esowo ba jolo go nkꞌkula ngare.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Herod wuku kan a me, á kehm bungu re, “Jon ji nwohngalahb wo, ye ji n kim-e esi. Yebkpe fere nyahme.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Tibre nyanjehle Herod tꞌtum re bo bob Jon ba a ne, ba gba-e kak go ngbekobo. Herod limi jia tib go esi ji Herodias ji á taare Filip mmonannyehn.<verse eid="MRK 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Jon ji nwohngalahb jo tongo Herod re, “Nobem re wo baange nkal a mmonanne.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Herodias kehm kehme elmarre a Jon. Á bele erakatahng re á bahk-e wulu. Á malem. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Tibre Herod jo fahle Jon, tib eji á jo kahn re, Jon jolo etingitingi nne Esowo. Herod jo sebe re á tahre elkpin ene. Jo kor-e re á jo wuungu atung go alum nya Jon, jol eji alum nyao jo gbiing-e gbiingi, fere ka-e atꞌtiiri go eltim.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Efung elbuumu bi bo jele Herod, Herodias kehm bele eyake. Tibre Herod tiingi atul elkak, fere tiingi atubesi nsoja, a anebkul nfam ba Galili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mmon a Herodias no nkal kehm lohngo ba yel, kehm kehme ese bahn. Kehm yebe ntul a Herod atahng, a ane ebe. Á kehm bahbe mmonse noo re, “Jen ji a kpꞌsebe re me n ka-a! M bahk-a kake ajehng ajehng ji a sebe no.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Herod kehm nyame, fere tꞌtir re, “Ajehng ajehng ji a lꞌbahb-m, m bahk-a kake, jol afi ejang afang ejame ji, m bahk-a kak.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Mmon noo kehm soro lohng tahm, song bahb nnyehn re, “Jen ji m bahk-e bahbe?” Nnyehn kehm faange re, “Esi ji Jon ji nwohngalahb.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mmon noo kehm feere elwaare elwaare, ba goji ntul, ba tong-e re, “N kpꞌsebe re, wo ka-m esi ji Jon go ekpingi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Jia limi ntul, á kehme elguunu. Á kpeem ma ten, tib eji á ma tohko nyam ano, fere tir go esamahr ane kpee. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Á kehm soro tum nlokeltum ewe na awohng re á song kim Jon esi ba a ji. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Nlokeltum noo kehm soro tahm, song rehng go ekpꞌkpa ngbekobo, song kim Jon esi, kak go ekpingi, ba ka mmon noo. Mmon noo kehm soro rod fvfo, song ka nnyehn.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Abatꞌtoono Jon wuku kan a me, bo kehm song rod ekv eje, song kpa kak go ndi.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos le ellong ane gbalee (5,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jon 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Abatiingetib Jisos kehm feere ba kpir-e, ba kehm-e nsol tong nyi bo ma lim kpee, fere tꞌtib. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Etahk ji Jisos jolo no, ane bako jo yele na, egom jehko jo lohng. Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe belem ngare nyi nsol alehke. Á kehm bungu tong bo re, “Wahr tahmen go edi ji li soom. Go wo ḿ bahke ma re ekv.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Bo kehm yele go egbang tahm go edi ji li soom.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ane gbalee nyehne bo eji bo tahme no, fere liingi bo. Owo ane kehm lohngo ajahbe nyao kpee, jo jen egbuk egbuk, gbo mbang song rehng edi jio, Bab Jisos kehm rehnge. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Jisos lohngo kan egbang, á kehm nyehne ellong ane gbalee. Ndon kehm-e fili. Tibre bo jolo ana ejoro bi ki kpi mbꞌbaabe. Á kehm kehme bo nsol tib gbalee.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Eji atv yahke behde, abatꞌtoono ebe kehm bake, ba bung tong-e re, “Tahm edi jia ana rehng go ajahbe, ekidi kpꞌlabe, gana, atv yahke behde. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Tum bo, bo song go abon ajahbe ba li a kpidi kpidi, song gunu nsol alehke.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Wahn kaan bo nsol alehke, bo li!” Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “A kpꞌsebe re, wahr song gunu nsol go mpon atahl alon, ba le boa?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Ebred ebbik ń kpi no? Song kpuren!” Eji bo ma song kpur, bo kehm bake, ba tong-e re, “Ebred eblon, kunu abon nsahre abal.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Jisos kehm tongo ane bao re, bo ji agꞌgabe agꞌgabe go ajele nya kpꞌna kohdo. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bo kehm jehke. Nlong nyindiki jo jolo ane atahl alon alon. Nlong nyindiki jo jolo ane atahl abal ane awubu, ane atahl abal ane awubu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Jisos kehm rodo ebred eblon bio, a abon nsahre abal, seenge go elbung, kak Esowo saam, kehm bakke abred nyao, ka abatꞌtoono ebe re bo ko song bak bo. Fvfo, á kehm kpe bakke abon nsahre bao na abal, bo tob song bak bo kpee. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bo kpee li wohngo.<verse eid="MRK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm taare erik abred nyao, a nsahre, kak ajeere, ruru ewubu ejeere ebbal. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Aneblum ba li abred nyao jolo ane atahltahl nkpel ewubbal ane atahl awubu (5,000). Anebkal, a abonse, bo fangem bo.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos jene go ero alahb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jon 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Tvtv o Jisos kehm soro tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, bo yel egbang, gbo-e mbang, song egbuk jehko ji Betsaida, yefono ji, jo yaame ane. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Eji á ma tong ellong ane bao re bo song kehnge, á kehm tahme go ewong re á song kak ero.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Eji elgung ma ba, egbang bio jolo go nlum alahb. Jisos sa ntahngtahng go ewong. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Jisos kehm nyehne re, abatꞌtoono ebe ebbel nfem go egbang, nyi jo lim bo re, bo kꞌma kpe fing egbang. Tibre nfeb jo gbulu bo, feere njahm njahm. Eji ma rehng ejum nkaranka eni nyi efungfu, Jisos kehm kehme eljene go ero alahb asongo goji bo. Á jo jene, are á yahke sehng bo. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Bo kehm-e nyehne, á kpꞌjene go ero alahb. Bo tiri re, etohko ji. Bo kehm kehme elrabe.<verse eid="MRK 6:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Eji bo kpee nyehn-e no, bo kehm kehme elfahle. Jisos kehm soro tong bo re, “Me wo, kana kpe fahl! Boben eltim!”<verse eid="MRK 6:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Á kehm ba yel egbang. Nfeb kehm soro rahke. Abatꞌtoono ebe kpo bo esi sehng. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Bo kahnem ana abred nyao lohngo no. Tibre jolo bo ekpehlekpehle.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi aneb ayam nob go Galili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Bo rehnge kan egbuk eto jehko, edi ndi ji bo jo lung re Genesaret, song kahn egbang ebo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Bo lohngo kan a egbang me, ane kehm soro liingi Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Bo kehm tahme, yel nkpohko ejahbe anyehng anyehng, jo sol aneb ayam go ebkpa, ba edi ajehng ajehng ji bo lꞌwuk re Jisos ebrehng o. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ajahbe nya nnen, a ajahbe nyi ki ga gbal, a abon ajahbe ba nse, ane gbalee jo ko aneb ayam ebo, je go are, fere gboongo Jisos re á lub taame, bo koor-e go ege asꞌsili nsubu. Ane kpee ba jo koor-e, jo lꞌlohko nob.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Eltibi ni anebkul Jus tibi no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bab Farisi, a atꞌtibi ba atahm bandiki kehm lohngo go Jeusalem ba goji Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Bo nyehne re, abatꞌtoono Jisos bandiki joom kpe ru abo go mbang nyi atꞌtibi ba atahm jo kono eltibi, kehm lehke nsol. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Farisis, a Jus kpee joom tiki li na li nsol, kꞌru abo. Tibre bo jo toono eljini ni babnde ebo jo tib bo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Bo lꞌje are feere, bo nehm tiki li nsol, bo tohko tiki bum elbo saang. Bo jo toono eljini nehko go fvfo, nio ni babnde jo tib bo, ana eljini ntuku aruku, a ni atu aruku, a ni nkpingi aruku. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Bab Farisi, a atꞌtibi ba atahm bao kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Jen ji wahnge abatꞌtoono eba kil jo toono eljini ni babnso ejahre tib-r no? Bo kpehme ru abo kehm lehke nsol!” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Wahn aneb alum abal abal ba! Aisaya lohko nyehn amahr bada nahne! Lohko li ana á nyono no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Esowo re, Ane ebame kp-m kake go nnyo a nnyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">ntim ebo n wobem.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Bo kp-m kake mbol mbol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">eji bo kpꞌtibi atahm nya ane baka baka jehke no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">nya ki li nya Esowo.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Wahn ebyake atahm nya Esowo, fere kpꞌtoono eljini ni ane baka baka tibi no.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Jisos kehm kpe bung tong bo re, “Ebnob ka wahn, eji ḿ ma ten atahm nya Esowo, fere kpꞌlimi eljini ni babnso ejahne. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Moses bungu re, ‘Kak nso, a nne! Nne awohng awohng no lꞌfere su nde, a nnyehn, bo bahk-e wulu.’<verse eid="MRK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />“Ń kpo tib re, ‘Nne lꞌbel ejum ji kehn á jol kake nde ebo, a nnyehn, á lꞌfere bung re, Ejum jia li re Korban (ji lohngo re, li ka Esowo), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />á nehm kpe kak nde ebo, a nnyehn.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Jia lohngo re, wahn ebten ellum ni Esowo, fere kpꞌtibi atahm nya babnso ejahne. Elkohn nsol ana nyia li gbalee, nyi ń kpo tob lim fvfo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsol nyi kpo lim nne, á kꞌjo jol saang go ege eltim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Jisos kehm kpe lung ellong ane, kehm tongo bo re, “Wuungen atung, wahn ane kpee, wahn kahn! <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ejumjum limm, ji kpo yel nne go nnyo, kehm limi eltim ene sab. Ji kpo lohng nne go eltim, ji ji kpo lim eltim nne sab. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Wuungen atung! Nne no kpi atung, nong, á wuk!”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Jisos lohngo kan go ellong ane bao o rehng go etahk, abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e bahbe bade elgan nio ni á tubu no.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Á kehm bungu tong bo re, “Wahn ebgboolo ana ane bako goa? Wahn lenngema? Ji kpo yel nne go nnyo sang kpo lim nne sab. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Tibre kpehme yel go ege eltim. Kpo yel go ala, fere lohng go ngubjing.” Jisos bungu jia re, nsol alehke anyehng anyehng nyi ane kpo li, nꞌnob re wahr li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:14-15; Kol 2:16</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Á kehm kpe soro asi elbungu re, “Ji kpo lohng nne go ege atahng, ji ji kpo wahng ka nne kꞌjol saang. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Tibre go atahng ma nne, a eltim ene, owo abꞌbi kpo lohng, ana ebi ntir atahng, asꞌsa, ejv avohko, ewulane, anebkal akono, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />etong alahme, nkahng abare, abꞌbi, enehm, atahm agboko, amahr abaare ejum nne, afahnge akiimi lake ane, elgeere, a elgboolo. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Abꞌbi nyaa kpo lohng eltim nne. Nya nya kpo lim eltim nne sab.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnenkal no taame no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Jisos kehm tahme go ejahbe ajehng ji li kohlo Taya, song yel ekpꞌkpa ajehng. Tibre á joom seb re, nne awohng awohng kahn re, á li o. Á maam tiki biiri. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Nnenkal awohng no mmon ewe no nkal bele ebi etohko go ege atahng kehm wuku bada Jisos. Á kehm ba kpir-e, soro gbo tvtv, jamm-e alahng. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mmonankal noo jolo nfono ejahbe no jo bung Grik. Á kehm gboongo Jisos re, á lub kam ebi etohko jio, yehke mmon ewe go eltim.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jisos kehm-e faange re, “Nong, me n tohko gbo mbang le abon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:24; Elt 13:46</char></note> Nobem re me n rod nsol alehke nyi abon, ka ebv.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Nnenkal noo kehm taame re, “Ee nsoo, fvfo, n kpꞌkahne re, akahb elang nya abon lꞌfooro gbo ndi, ebv bi kpo fohko li.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:12</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Jisos kehm bungu tong-e re, “Tib go ellum ni a faange no, a li ma song kehnge, tibre mmon ewa, ebi etohko m-e lohng go ege eltim.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Nnyehn kehm feere je, lohko song nyehn mmon ewe nong go edilnong sange sange. Ebi etohko jio m-e lohko lohng.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi nlakatung wuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Jisos kehm sehnge go Taya asongo, song rehng go Saidon, fere song rehng go Dekapolis,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 5:20</char></note> tete song rehng go eto ji Galili.<verse eid="MRK 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ane kehm koko nlakatung nyi ki jo ma bung nob nob, ba a ne goji Jisos, fere gboongo Jisos re, á lub kun-e ebo.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Jisos kehm-e koko, lohng a ne go ellong ane bao, kehm-e lohko anyohkebo go atung, fere so atel wohngo go ebnyohkobo abehng, ko song behd-e go ebliki. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Jisos kehm kpiidi amahr enye go elbung, tub eromo, kehm bungu tong nne noo re, “Efata,” ji lohngo re, “Lennge!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Tvtv o atung nne noo soro lennge, ebliki soro tahm. Á kehme elbungu nob nob. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, bo kꞌtooro tong ane. Jol eji á rehke rehke bo o, ano wo fvfo bo tob tooro kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 19:40; Mat 12:34</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Nne awohng awohng no wuku no, jo kpo-e esi area. Bo re, “Yeblim ejum ajehng ajehng ebnob go nseenga nseenge, ye jio ji kpo lim alakatung, bo wuk, fere lim akamme, bo bung.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpe le ellong ane bako (4,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Gaam kang fvfo, ellong ane bako kehm kpe ba. Eji bo ki kpe bel ejum ellehke ajehng ajehng, Jisos kehm lungu abatꞌtoono ebe tv elne, kehm bungu tong bo re, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ndon ma-m fili sehng. Tibre ane baa ebkang nfung era a name. Ejumjum bo kpeem kpi ji ellehke. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Re me n tum bo ana, bo song kehnge, egom jindiki bahke kehme awo gbo mbang mbang, tib ane bandiki lohng nlaabambang ba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm-e faange re, “Elka emahng nia, gan wo nne bahke tingi nsol alehke, kehm leke elkohn ane ana baa kpee?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Ebred ebbik ń kpi no?” Bo kehm-e faange re, “E kpi ebred ebsehma.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Á kehm tongo ellong ane bao re, bo ji ndi. Á kehm rodo ebred ebsehma bio, kehm kake Esowo saam, kehm bakke ka abatꞌtoono ebe re bo song bak. Abatꞌtoono ebe lohko lim ano. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Bo bele abon nsahre abik abik o fvfo. Jisos kehm kake Esowo saam go nsol nyia, fere tong abatꞌtoono ebe re bo tob song bak.<verse eid="MRK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Nne awohng awohng lꞌli wohngo. Owo abatꞌtoono ebe kehm taare erik ji sa no, ruru ejeere na ebsehma. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Bo jolo ejum ane atahltahl nkpel ewubu (4,000). Jisos kehm tongo ane bao re bo song kehnge.<verse eid="MRK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Á kehm yele go egbang, a abatꞌtoono ebe. Bo kehm tahme go ejahbe ji bo jo lung re Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Bab Farisi sebe re bo nyehn nkpokosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bab Farisi kehm ba kehme Jisos abahbe bahb go nfaabe re, bo nyehn nkpokosi nyi ejahbetul Esowo, eji bo lꞌgar-e.<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Jisos kehm tubu eromo, kehm bungu re, “Jen ji wahng ka ane ba li anv kpꞌsebe re bo nyehn nkpokosi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 1:22</char></note> Ellingi anehng anehng nehm jol ka ane bao.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Á kehm tahme bo sa, song yel go egbang, tahm egbuk eto jehko.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayist nyao nya Farisis, a nya Herod</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Abatꞌtoono ebe yꞌyini abred go elkoko ba a nya. Sa mmobred awohng wo wo go egbang.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Jisos kehm kake bo erehke re, “Gberen elnahne go ayist nyao nya Farisis, a nya Herod.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm kehme elbungu atemtem. Bo bumu re, Jisos bungu alum nyaa, tib eji bo ki bel abred.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jisos kꞌkahn re, lenngem bo re á bungu bade eltibi ni ane bao. Owo á kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji ń kpꞌbungu bade abred nya ń ki kpi? Ń nehme nyehna? Ń nehme wuka? Anv, li-n ekpehlekpehla? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ń kpi amahr, ń nehme nyehna? Ń kpi atung, ń nehme wuka? Ń nehme kpe buuma, <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />ana m bakke ebred eblon, ka ane atahltahl nkpel ewubbal atahl awuba (5,000)? Ejeere ebbik ń ko arꞌrohko kak tahm a nya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Bo kehm faange re, “Ewubu ejeere ebbal.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Nyanjehle, eji m bakke ebred na ebsehma, ka ane atahltahl nkpel ewubu (4,000), ejeere ebbik ń ko arꞌrohko kak tahm a nya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Bo faange re, “Ejeere ebsehma.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Jisos kehm kpe bahb bo re, “Wahn ka tiki lennga?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos lim nwakamahr, á nob go Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe je go Betsaida. Ane bako kehm koko nwakamahr je goji Jisos, song gboong-e re, á lub koor-e.<verse eid="MRK 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jisos kehm jabbe nwakamahr nyio go ebo, lohng a ne tahm go esi mbang. Á so atel, kak nne noo go amahr, kehm-e kooro abo go amahr, kehm-e bahbe re, “Anv, a bahke ma nyehn ejuma?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Nne noo kehm lennge amahr enye, kehm bungu re, “N kpꞌnyehne ane. Bo li na li, are nti nyi kpꞌjene yannge.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Jisos kehm-e kpe kooro abo go amahr. Ngare nyio nne noo kehm gohro lennge amahr enye, amahr enye kehm feere ana wuku wuku. Á kehm nyehne ejum ajehng ajehng saang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:18</char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Jisos kehm-e tumu re, á song kehnge, fere tong-e re, á kꞌsehng mbang ejahbe jio ji bo kpꞌna lohngo abake.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ellum ni Pita bungu bada Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Jisos kehm tahme, a abatꞌtoono ebe song rehng go abon ajahbe ba bo jo lung re Sisaria Filipi. Eji bo kpꞌjene go mbang, á kehm bahbe bo re, “Tong-m wahn, ane kpo bung renan bada name? Me n li elkohn nne awo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bo kehm faange re, “Egom jindiki kpo bung re, Wo Jon ji nwohngalahb wo. Egom jindiki re, Wo Elaija wo. Egom jindiki re, Wo nnyehnamahr Esowo wo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Wahn fvfo mee? Wahn kpo bung renan bada name? Me n li elkohn nne awo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pita kehm-e faange re, “Wo Kraist wo!” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Jisos kehm rehke bo re, bo kꞌtong nnene ejum ajehng ajehng bada ne.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu bade erem ebe, a elkv ene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Jisos kehm kehme abatꞌtoono ebe tib re, “Mmon no nne bahke nyehne erem gbalee. Anebkul nfam, a atubesi abalimajom, go atꞌtibi ba atahm bahk-e tene, fere wul-e. Lꞌkang nfung era á nyahme, fere jol go elkpin.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Jisos jo bungu alum nyao gbul gbul gbuul.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:32">Pita kehm-e koko, tahm a ne go nkpohko, kehm-e kehme elrehke.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Jisos kehm keebe, seenge abatꞌtoono ebe, kehm nyame Pita re, “Nnehm, fak-m go esamahr! Ntir enya nyi nne nyi, nyi Esowo sang.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Jisos kehm lungu ellong ane tv elne, fere tob lung abatꞌtoono ebe, kehm tongo bo re, “Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtong re, á kp-m toono, nong á ten elne tv-m, fere rod ekros eje, tahm toon-m.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:28; 2 Kor 11:24-26; 2 Tim 3:12</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Nne no lꞌtong re, á bahke tahre elkpin ene go njini nyia, á bahke fere tane na elkpin ene. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌfere tane elkpin ene tib go egame esi, a esi ji alum Esowo, á bahke bele na etingitingi elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:3; 6:63</char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />“Li re nne bahke bele afang nya njini nyia kpee, fere tane etohko eje, nsehng anyi á bahke lehke? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ejumjum limm, ji nne bahke kake, kehm fake etohko eje. <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Nne no lꞌdaang-m tib go egame alum go ebꞌbi njini nyia nyi ma ten Esowo, Mmon no nne bahke tob daang-e, á lꞌba go ellub ni nde, a abarebare enjel.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yaange ngubjing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Jisos kehm soro asi elbungu re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Egom jindiki ji yim a, nehm tiki kpo, tete bo nyehn etul bi Esowo ma badde ba go njini nyia a nsahm a nsahm.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Kange kan nfung erakera, Jisos kehm yehke Pita, Jems, a Jon tahm a bo go ewong ji wahre wahre. Jisos kehm yaange ngubjing enye o. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Nsol nyi á kake no kehm bare kparaang, fere jo yꞌya. Nnene limm go njini nyia, no bahke ma baare elkohn ana nio. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Elaija abola Moses kehm lohngo ba bung a Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pita kehm bungu tong Jisos re, “Nsoo, nꞌnob re wahr jol a. E bahke sehke nkpatahk na era, ebkpatahk behko bꞌba, behko bi Elaija, behko bi Moses.”<verse eid="MRK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Pita kahnem ana ji á bahke bungu, tibre bo jo fꞌfahl.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Ekparesemsem kehm soro tahl ba bulu bo. Bo kehm wuku ellum go ekparesemsem re, “A wo li akor-m mmon ewame no kpo kor-m sꞌsehng. Wuken ye!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 1:17</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm soro kehme eljange. Bo kpeem nyehn nnene, sehngem Jisos ntahngtahng wo bo nyehn-e no.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Eji bo jo badde abake go nnahb ewong, Jisos kehm rehke bo re, “Kana tiki tong nnene ji ń nyehne no, tete Mmon no nne nyahme go elkv.” <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bo lohko bum erehke jio ji á kake bo. Bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Elnyahme ngubjing go elkv nia lohngo renan?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Bo kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Jen ji wahng ka atꞌtibi ba atahm kpo bung re, Elaija bahke tohko gbo mbang ba?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Á kehm faange bo re, “Elaija bahke tohko gbo mbang ba, ba tuungu nsol kpee bum. Nwer Esowo bungu renan bada Mmon no nne? Bungu re, Mmon no nne bahke nyehne erem, bo bahk-e tene. <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />N kp-n tongo re, Elaija eblohko ba. Bo lim-e ana ji koro bo, jang jang ana nwer Esowo bungu no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:14</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi mmonse no bele ebi etohko, á nob.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-42">Luk 9:37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Bo feere kan ana, bo kehm ba kpiri abatꞌtoono baka gana, fere nyehn ellong ane tvv ma sennge bo kak. Atꞌtibi ba atahm bandiki jo limi nfaabe a abatꞌtoono Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ane bao nyehne kan Jisos ana, kehm kpoko bo esi. Bo kehm soro be tvtv song wan-e, kak-e nnyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌlꞌlim nfaabe?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Nne awohng go ellong ane bao kehm faange re, “Nsoo, n ko mmon ewame ba a ne. Tibre á kpi ebi etohko go ege atahng. Á nehme ma bung. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Edi ajehng ajehng ji ebi etohko jio lꞌsi mehl-e mehl, kpo rod-e tub ndi, nfahl jo tub-e na tub go nnyo. Á kpo kono amahn go esi, fere tahne na tahne. Me n gboongo abatꞌtoono eba re, bo kam-e ebi etohko jio jehke. Bo maam lim.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Jisos kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kpi ekꞌtaame go egahna ntim? M bahke kange renan a nahne? Ko mmon noo, ba a ne!”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Bo ko-e kan a, ba a ne, ebi etohko jio nyehne kan Jisos a, á kehm limi mmon noo, á gbo ngboko, fere gbo ndi, kehm kehme elgbehde. Nfahl jo tub-e go nnyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jisos kehm bahbe nde re, “Ebkang renan eji eyam bia bom-e no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Á kehm-e faange re, “Bomo ngare nyi á jolo mmonse ntiil, tete rehng anv. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Nkpel tvv ebi etohko jio kpo gare re á wul-e. Nkpel nyindiki tub-e kak agun. Nkpel nyindiki tub-e kak alahb. Nong, wahr fil-a ndon, wo kak-r ebo, tohk-a jahk!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Wobbung re, ‘Tohk-m jahk.’ Nne no lꞌtaame, ejumjum limm, ji bahk-e riidi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Nde kehm soro rabe tvtv re, “Me n taame, kak-m ebo go egame ekꞌtaame.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:7</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Eji Jisos nyehne re, ellong ane bao kpꞌkame ba rur, á kehm nyame ebi etohko jio, fere tong-e re, “Etohko ji kpo lim nne gbo ekamme, fere lak atung, ka kpe tiki yel mmon noa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Tvtv o ebi etohko jio kehm biingi tiim, kehm soro yehke mmon noo, á gbo ngboko ekidi lꞌlab. Ebi etohko jio kehm soro lohng-e. Mmon noo kehm sake noongo, are nkvne nyi. Owo ane bandiki kehm kehme elbungu re, “Yebkpo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Jisos kehm jabbe mmon noo go ebo, tab-e yiimi, mmon noo lohko yiimi.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Jisos yele kan ekpꞌkpa me, abatꞌtoono ebe kehm bake, ba bahb-e eji bo jolo ebo ebo re, “Jen ji wahnge wahr ki ma kam mmon noo ebi etohko jio yehke?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Elkohn etohko ana jio, ń nehm ma tiki kam yehke, tohko tiki jol re, ero akake bi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpe bung bade elkv ene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Bo kehm tahme ejahbe jio asongo go Galili. Jisos joom seb re nne awohng awohng kahn edi ji á li no. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Tibre á jo tibi abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Mmon no nne, bo bahk-e rodo, kak abi ane go ebo, bo bahk-e wulu. Lꞌkang nfung era, á nyahme, jol go elkpin.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Bo kahnem ji á jo bꞌbung. Bo jo fꞌfahl a ye bahb.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elkohn nne awo li ntubesi?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Eji bo song rehng go Kapenium, bo kehm yele go ekpꞌkpa. Jisos kehm bahbe abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Jen ji wahnge ń jo lim nfaabe mbang mbang?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Jol bo we faangem. Tibre bo jo limi nfaabe mbang mbang bada nne no li njꞌjoka nne go bo ellong.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Jisos kehm jehke, kehm lungu abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal tv elne, kehm bungu tong bo re, “Nne no lꞌtong re, ye wo li ntubesi, á bahke fere jol nkahlanjahm, fere jol nlokeltum no bahke jo loko ane kpee.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 4:9-14; 1 Pit 5:3</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Á kehm koko mmonse ba yiimi go bo a mbuksong, kehm-e kpaake ebo, kehm bungu tong bo re,<verse eid="MRK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Nne no lꞌko mmonse ana noa a go egama mbing, á ma-m tob ko. Nne no lꞌko-m, á tob ko Nsoo no tum-m no.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:40</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne no ki li nnekv ewahre, ye nne ewahre wo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Jon kehm bungu tong Jisos re, “Wahr ebnyehn nne no kpo kam ane abi atohko yehke go ega a mbing. Go egahre ellong á wobem. E sahd-e sahde re á rahke, tibre á wobem go egahre ellong.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Kana ye sahde re á rahke. Tibre nnene limm, no bahke limi nkpokosi go egama mbing, kehm fere jo bung abꞌbi bada name. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Etingitingi, nne no tohk-r ko ekv, ye nne ewahre wo. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nne no lꞌka-n mmobtuku alahb tib eji ń li abatꞌtoono ba Kraist, á bahke bele eltuuru go etingitingi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:40-42</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsol nyi kpo wahng nne yel abiafem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Ga nob re, bo kahn nne eltal go emel, tub-e kak alahb, sehnge re á lim mmonse no ma taame tv-m, á gbo yel abiafem.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />“Ebo eba lꞌkehm-a limi re wo yel abiafem, kim ebo bio tub go. Ga nob re wo bel ebo abehng, kpo, yel ejahbetul Esowo, sehnge re wo bel abo abal abal, kpo, je ellulagun ni lꞌkꞌtiki lahme go njinanjini. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Go wo aroongo nya kpo li abi ane lꞌkꞌtiki kpo. Agun nehm tiki lahme.<verse eid="MRK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />“Ekpade eja lꞌkehm-a limi re wo yel abiafem, kim ekpade jio tub go. Ga nob re wo jen ekpade ajehng, kpo, yel ejahbetul Esowo, sehnge re wo jen akpade abal abal, kpo, je go ellulagun. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Go wo aroongo nya kpo li abi ane lꞌkꞌtiki kpo. Agun nehm tiki lahme.<verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />“Elmahr ena lꞌkehm-a limi re wo yel abiafem, luudu elmahr nio tub go.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 3:5-9</char></note> Ga nob re wo bel elmahr anehng, kpo, yel ejahbetul Esowo, sehnge re wo bel amahr abal abal, kpo, je go ellulagun. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Go wo aroongo nya kpo li abi ane lꞌkꞌtiki kpo. Agun nehm tiki lahme.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Nne awohng awohng, Esowo bahk-e doobo go agun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:11; 1 Pit 4:12</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Akang kpꞌnobo. Elyebe akang lꞌlohng, a bahke limi renan, kehm kpe yebe?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:13</char></note> Belen akang go egahne atahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:6</char></note> Jolen go elkoono atemtem!”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu bade elbal amale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Jisos kehm tahme edi jio, siiri aya ma bo kpo lung re Jodan, rehng go egbuk jehko ji Judea. Fvfo, ellong ane kehm kpe ba rur. Á kehm kpe tib bo ana á kpo kono eltibi. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Egom Farisi jindiki kehm bake re bo ba gar-e. Owo bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Tong-r, ntahm enyahre bꞌbung re, nne li ma ten nkal ewe no jehk-e go etahka?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jisos kehm faange a mbahbe re, “Atahm anya Moses tib-n no?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bo faange re, “Moses tib-r re, nne yeele nwer, ka nkal ewe, kehm-e yehke elbal.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Moses nyono nsol nyia tib go egahne etahnsi. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Go mbomannahb eji Esowo limi njini, ‘Á limi nnenlum, a nnenkal. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Jia ji bahke wahng ka nne bahke tahme nde, a nnyehn sa, bo song jol abola nkal ewe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />bo fere jol ana ngubjing anyehng.’ Bo nehm kpe jol ane abal. Bo bahke fere jol ana nne awohng. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ji Esowo ma kono edi ajehng, nne kꞌyaame.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Bo feere kan a song rehng go bo etahk, abatꞌtoono ebe kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Ellum ni a kpꞌna bungu lohngo renan?”<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Á kehm bungu tong bo re, “Nne awohng awohng no lꞌten nkal ewe, fere song baange nondiki, yeblim abiafem nyao nya erehbe go esamahr bi Esowo tob nkal no á gbo mbang baang-e. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ano wo fvfo tob li ka nnenkal no lꞌbe nlum ewe sa, fere song bal nlum nondiki. Yebtob lim abiafem nya erehbe go esamahr bi Esowo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos fuulu abon ba nse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Ane bako ko abon ba nse, ba goji Jisos re á kooro bo abo. Abatꞌtoono ebe jo sebe re bo sahde ane bao.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Jisos wuku kan a me, atahng kehm-e rake. Á kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Yaken abonsꞌsohko abonse ba ga egame! Kana kpe sahde bo! Tibre elkohn ane ana abonse baa, bo ba etul bi Esowo li ka bo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nne awohng awohng no tohko taame, woomo go elwo ni Esowo ana mmonse kpo woomo go elwo ni nde, etul bi Esowo á nehm li.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:3</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Á kehm koko abonse bao, kpaake bo abo, kehm kunu bo abo, jo fuulu bo.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efange nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Eji Jisos ma tahm eljen ene, á kehm nyehne nne ma be, ba jamm-e alahng, kehm-e bahbe re, “Nnooba ntꞌtibi, m bahke limi renan, kehm bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, “Jen ji wahng ka, a kehm-m lungu re nnooba ntꞌtibi? Nnene limm, no li nnooba nne, sehngem Esowo ntahngtahng bi li nnooba nne. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />A kpꞌkahne atahm nya bungu re, ‘Ka wul nne! Ka kak afem nya erehbe! Ka v ejv! Ka yiimi ntianse efahnge! Ka nehm nne! Kak nso, a nne!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Nne noo kehm bungu re, “Ntꞌtibi, jol bomo ngare nyi n jolo ntiil tete ba rehng anv, nyaa kpee n kpo bꞌbum.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Go elkoro wo Jisos kpiidi amahr enye seeng-e, kehm-e tongo re, “Ejum ajehng ji ma-a sa. Song, wo song gungu nsol afang enya, ko ba ka akpak! Owo a bahke bele afang go ejahbetul Esowo, wo ba, ba toon-m.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:38</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Nne noa wuku kan ano, esamahr kehm-e gbodo. Á kehm soro tahm eje ndon ndon. Tibre á fange sehng.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jisos kehm keebe, tong abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Bahke riidi, afang ane kehm yele go ejahbetul Esowo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Abatꞌtoono ebe, alum nyao gbale bo go eltim sehng. Jisos kehm kpe bung tong bo re, “Ate ebame, bahke riidi area, nne kehm yele ejahbetul Esowo. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Re efange nne kehm yele go ejahbetul Esowo, ekamel bahke sehnge go mbang a nga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:3; Hib 11:6</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Kpo na kpo abatꞌtoono ebe esi tete ga. Bo kehm-e bahbe re, “Wo, nne awo bahke bele eltahre me lꞌlun?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jisos kehm keebe, seenge bo, kehm bungu re, “Ji nne lꞌkꞌma lim, goji Esowo riidem. Ajehng ajehng limm, ji kpo riidi Esowo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Pita kehm bungu re, “Wahr jia, eji e li a, wahr ebyake ejum ajehng ajehng kpi wo toono.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nne awohng awohng no lꞌyake etahk eje, fere yake abonanyehn, nnyehn, nde, abon ebe, egbe eje, tib go egame esi, a esi ji alum Esowo, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />á bahke bele na budu. Á bahke bele na ntahk budu nkpel atahl alon, bel abonanyehn, bab nnyehn, abon, a ebgbe. Fvfo, ebnohko bia. Go ngare esꞌsong, á bahke bele elkpin ni li go njinanjini. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ane gbalee ba li agbokombang bahke fere jol akahlenjahm. Fvfo, ane gbalee ba li akahlenjahm bahke fere jol agbokombang.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos gohro bung bade elkv ene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Eji bo jo tahm go Jeusalem, Jisos gbo abatꞌtoono ebe mbang. Ala jo teele bo sehng. Ane bako ba jo toono bo go njahm jo fꞌfahl.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:32">Jisos kehm kpe yehke abatꞌtoono ebe, kehm kpe tong bo nsol nyi bahk-e limi. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Á bungu re, “Nyehnen, anv, e kpꞌtahme go Jeusalem. Owo Mmon no nne, bo bahk-e rodo, kak atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm go abo. Bo bahke kimi elam ji bo bahk-e wulu, fere rod-e, kak ane bako ba ki li Jus go abo. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bo bahk-e nyoko, fere jo so atel wohng-e, dv-e tete bo wul-e. Lꞌkang nfung era, á nyahme go elkv, fere jol go elkpin.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi Jems abola Jon bahbe no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Abon Sibidi, Jems abola Jon kehm bake goji Jisos, ba tong-e re, “Ntꞌtibi, ejum jia, ji e kpꞌsebe re, wo lim ka-r.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Jisos kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji ń kpꞌsebe re me n lim ka-n?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bo kehm-e faange re, “Ngare nyi a ma ji go ega eti etul, e kpꞌsebe re wahr tob ji a na o, noko go ega ejang eboblum, noko go ega ejang ebobkal.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Ń nehme kahn ji ń kpꞌbꞌbahb. Ḿ bahke ma nyehn erem bi me m bahke nyehna? Ḿ bahke ma bel ewohngalahb ji m bahke bela?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bo kehm faange re, “Ee, e bahke ma bel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Etingitingi, ḿ bahke tob nyehn erem bi m bahke nyehne, fere bel ewohngalahb ji m bahke bele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 1:9</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Nsahm me n kpimm, nyi m bahke yehke ane re, noko ji go egame ejang eboblum, noko ji egame ejang ebobkal. Esowo bi bi bahke kake ane bao adi nya á ma toobo re á ka bo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Erik abatꞌtoono baka gana, ane awubu, wuku kan a bade Jems, a Jon, eltim kehm kehme bo rak tob bo.<verse eid="MRK 10:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Jisos kehm lungu bo kpee, kehm tongo bo re, “Ń kpꞌkahne re, ane ba bo yehke bo re bo jol atul, bo kpi nsahm nyi bo kpo fili ane ebo tꞌtahne. Ajꞌjok ane, bo ba kpo fili bo tꞌtahne. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Wahn, kana jo lim ano! Nne awohng awohng ewahne no lꞌseb re á jol njꞌjoka nne, á bahke fere jol nlokeltum ka wahn ane kpee. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Nne awohng awohng ewahne no lꞌfere seb re á jol ntubesi, á bahke fere jol nju ka wahn ane kpee. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Tibre Mmon no nne baam re bo jo lok-e, á ba re á ba loko na, fere ka elkpin ene, tahre ane gbalee yake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:25-27</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos limi Batimos, á nyehn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Bo kehm bake go Jeriko. Eji Jisos lohngo no, a abatꞌtoono ebe, a ellong ane ba jo toon-e, nwakamahr a nne no bo jo lung-e re Batimos ji mmon a Timeus ji nkpe a mbang ona, jo gboongo ane nsol. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Á wuku kan a re Jisos ji Nasaret wo, á kehm kehme elrabe re, “Jisos ji mmon a Devid, me n lub fil-a ndon!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Ane gbalee kehm-e kehme elnyame re, á rahke ewok.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:48">Jol á jo kpe rabe na wahre wahre re, “Mmon a Devid, me n lub fil-a ndon!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Jisos kehm yiimi, kehm bungu re, “Lungen ye tv-m!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Bo kehm lungu nwakamahr nyio re á ba. Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Bob eltim, wo tahm ba, á kp-a lungu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Á kehm tahnge mbomo eme tub, mehl karab yiimi, kehm jeke goji Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jisos kehm-e bahbe re, “A kpꞌsebe re me n lim jen ka-a?” Nwakamahr nyio kehm bungu re, “Ntꞌtibi, n kpꞌsebe re me n lub nyehn!”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jisos kehm-e tongo re, “Song, eltaame ena ni ma wahng ka, a ma nyehn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Tvtv o á kehm soro nyehn, tahm toono Jisos mbang mbang asongo.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yele go Jeusalem, a egburu ellub</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Eji bo ma jen kabbe go Jeusalem, a abon ajahbe ba li sennge o kak, ana Betfage abola Betani ba li kohlo ewong ji bo kpo lung re Oliv, Jisos kehm yehke abatꞌtoono ebe na abal, tum re bo song. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Á tongo bo re, “Songen ejahbe jio o ji li egahna mbuksong. Ń lꞌsi rꞌrehng o, ḿ bahke nyehne mmombvankang no bo kal-e kꞌkuumu. Fanngen ye, wahn ko-e ba! <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Nne awohng awohng lꞌfere bahb-n re, ‘Ń kpi jen lim a ne?’ tongen ye re, ‘Ntul wo kp-e sebe.’ Nfona mbvankang bahk-e yake elwaare ka-n.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bo kehm jeke, lohko song nyehn mmombvankang nonehm o, bo m-e kahn kohlo go mbutahk. Eji bo jo fannge, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />ane ba yiimi o kehm bahbe bo re, “Jen ji ń kpꞌlimi o? Jen ji wahnge ń kpꞌfannge mmombvankang noo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Bo kehm faange bo ana Jisos tongo bo. Bo yake bo, bo tahm a ne. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bo kehm koko mmombvankang noo ba a ne goji Jisos. Bo kehm rodo abomo ebo, yal mmombvankang noo go njahm. Jisos kehm kuumu.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ane gbalee jo yale abomo ebo go mbang. Egom jindiki jo ja amang go emahng, jo ba yal go mbang. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ane bandiki gbo-e mbang, bandiki kahle njahm. Bo kpee kehm kehme elrabe re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Tehken Esowo!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Elfuulu jol ka nne no ma ba go mbing nyi Ntul!”<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Elfuulu jol ka etul bi Devid nso ejahre bi kpꞌbake!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Ellub jol ka Esowo bi li go ero!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Jisos kehm rehnge go Jeusalem, sehng song yange go etahk Esowo, kehm kehme elkpuru ejum ajehng ajehng ji jolo go etahk Esowo jio. Eji atv yahke behde, Jisos kehm tahme asongo go Betani, a abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyehne amahr bade efig</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Etoono efung behko eji bo tahme go Betani, jo jen asongo, Jisos, njal kehm-e yame. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Á kehm nyehne eti ji bo kpo lung re efig go fee ma tahb na tahb, jolo anyane anyane. Á kehm jeere, song rehng go nnahb re, fundiki á bahke tingi nkab anyehng. Eji á jeere no kohlo re á kpur me, jol kabem. Tibre ngare ka rehng nyi kpo kab. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Jisos kehm tongo eti jio re, “Nnene limm, no bahke kpe li nkab anyehng anyehng enya go etingitingi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:29</char></note> Abatꞌtoono ebe tꞌtob wuk.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos je go etahk Esowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Eji bo rehnge go Jeusalem, Jisos kehm yange go etahk Esowo, kehm song kam ane bao ba jo gungu, fere gꞌgunu. Á kehm gbulu akpꞌkuru nya ane ba jo yaange akpohko tub, fere gbul nti nyi ane ba jo gungu mbehl tub. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Á kpeem tiki taame re, nne awohng awohng jo sol ejum ajehng ajehng, sehng a ji etahk Esowo jio.<verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Á kehm tibi ane bao re, “Bo nyono go nwer Esowo re, Esowo re, ‘Etahk ejame, bo bahke jo lung re etahk ero akake ji li ka ane kpee.’ Wahn ebfere rod, bum ana ebehre awajv.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm wuku kan jia, bo kehm kehme mbang seb nyi bo bahke Jisos wul. Bo jo fahl-e fahl, tibre ellong ane bao kpo bo esi area tib go ege eltibi.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Elgung ba kan a, Jisos, a abatꞌtoono ebe kehm tahme ejahbe jio asongo.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ejum akpili bade eti jio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Etoono efung behko eji bo jo jen mbang mbang asongo, bo kehm nyehne eti jio ji ki kab akab ma kpo kpee tete rehng go alohk.<verse eid="MRK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pita kehm buumu ji ma lim, kehm bungu tong Jisos re, “Ntꞌtibi, nyehn! Eti ji nyaane a bungu no re bahke kpoko, eblohko kpo.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Taamen tv Esowo! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nne lꞌtaame tv Esowo, á li ma tong re, ‘Ewong mehl, song yiimi go aya!’ Ewong jio lohko mehl. Á tohko bel nfaabe go ege eltim, á lꞌfere taame re, ji á bahbe no bahke lohko lim, ji ji Esowo bahke tiki lim ka-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 17:20</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Owo wahng ka n kp-n tongo re, Ń lꞌkak ero, bahb ejum ajehng ajehng, taamen re wahn eblohko bel, ji ji ḿ bahke bele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:13</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />“Ń lꞌkehme ero kak, jo tahmen ka ate ebahne go ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń kpi no bada bo, goji Nso ejahne no li go ero lꞌtob tahm ka-n go egahne abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:23-24</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ń tohko jo tahm ka nne, Nso ejahne no li go ero nehm tob tahm ka-n go egahne abiafem.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bada nsahm nyi Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Bo kehm kpe feere go Jeusalem. Eji Jisos jolo go etahk Esowo, atubesi abalimajom, atꞌtibi ba atahm, a anebkul nfam kehm bake goji Jisos, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />kehm ba bahb-e re, “Nsahm anyi a kpi no, nyi a kpo lim elkohn nsol ana nyia?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Me fvfo, m bahk-n tob bahb mbahbe anyehng. Ń lꞌfaang-m, m bahk-n tongo nsahm ana nyi n kpi no, nyi n kpo lim nsol nyia. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Tong-m wahn, ewohngalahb ji Jon lohng goji Esowoa, afi lohng goji ane?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Bo kehm kehme nfaabe lim atemtem re, “E bahke bungu renan? E lꞌtong re ‘Ewohngalahb ji Jon lohng goji Esowo’, á bahk-r bahbe re, ‘Jen ji wahng ka ń ki taame tv alum nya Jon?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 3:7-12</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />E lꞌfere bung re, ‘Lohng goji nne’, ma ane bahk-r limi ejum nji?” Bo jo fahle ane, tibre nne awohng awohng jo sahb kꞌkahn re, Jon jolo etingitingi nnyehnamahr Esowo. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Owo wahnge bo kehm faange Jisos re, “E nehme kahn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Lꞌlun, wahn n nehm tob tong nsahm nyi wahng ka n kpo lim nsol nyia.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Elgan ni li bade abayaame etahngga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Jisos kehm kehme elbungu a bo go ngaane re, “Nne jolo go, no bahme avain, fere kak ega sennge. Á kehm rahme elbing ni bo jo kak akab nti, fere jo kaame akab nti nyao tv elbing nio, alahb jo lohng. Á si enyong, kak ane ba jo baabe edi jio, kehm yaame abahmgbe edi jio, toono eje tahm ejahbe jehko ji li fee. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ngare rehnge kan a, nyi bo kpo bong akab nti nyao. Nfono etahngga kehm tumu nlokeltum ewe awohng tv re á song ko akab nti enye goji ane ba á yaame bo etahngga eje. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Bo kehm-e tubu ejahm, dv-e tꞌtahne, kam-e, á feere abo abo. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Á kehm kpe tum nlokeltum noko. Bo kehm-e kpe dv, bom-e elok go esi, fere son-e. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Á kehm kpe tum nne noko. Ye, bo wul-e na. Ano wo tob lim egom jindiki ji á kpe tum. Bandiki bo dv bo. Bandiki bo wul na.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />“Awohng no gohr-e sa, ekorokoro mmon ewe wo. Esꞌkohro, á kehm-e gohro tum tv bo. Á tiri re, ‘Mmon ewame bahke lubu bo.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Abayaame etahngga bao kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, ‘A wo li nne no bahke lehke elkv ene. Baan, wahr wulen ye, eji etahngga jia lꞌfere jol jꞌjahre.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Bo kehm-e jabbe, wul-e, fere rod-e tub go nkpe etahngga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 13:12</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Jen ji nfono etahngga noo bahke limi? Á bahke wulu abayaame etahngga bao, fere faake etahngga jio ka ane bandiki. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Wahn ka lung a lung edi nwer Esowo jiaa, ji bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ ‘Eltal ni asehketahk tene no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">ni ni ma fere jol nnahb ekahma?<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Jehova limi jia ji li nkpokosi go egahra ntim.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Atubesi Jus kehm jo seb re bo bob Jisos. Bo jo kahne re, elgan nio á tubu bada bo. Bo jo fꞌfahl ellong ane ba jolo o. Bo kehm-e tahme sa, tahm ebo.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bade etak atahbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Bo kehm tumu egom Farisi jindiki, fere tob tum egom ane ba Herod tv Jisos re bo song bob-e go ege alum nnyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Eji bo je no, bo kehm bungu tong-e re, “Ntꞌtibi, e kpꞌkahne re, wo etingi nne ji. E kpꞌkahne re, wo kpehme rang ane. Nne awohng awohng li jang jang go ega esamahr. Á kpo lohko tib mbang nyi Esowo go etingitingi. Nꞌnob re wahr jo tahb etak ka ntul a Roma, afi nobem? Wahr jo tahba, afi wahr kꞌjo tahb?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Jisos kꞌkahn awak ebo, kehm fere tong bo re, “Jen ji wahnge ń kp-m gare? Ka-m wahn nsiring, me n tohko nyehn!”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bo kehm koko nsiring ba ka-e. Á kehm bahbe bo re, “Esi jia ji nyehne ji? Mbing nyia nyi nyehne nyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Bo kehm-e tongo re, “Esi jia ji ntul ji. Mbing nyia nyi ntul nyi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Ka-n ntul ji li ka ntul, wahn ka Esowo ji li ka Esowo!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:1-7</char></note> Jisos, kehm kpoko bo esi.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bade elnyahme ngubjing go elkv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Egom Sadusi jindiki kehm bake goji Jisos.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 5:17</char></note> Bo jo kono eltibi re, “Elnyahme ngubjing go elkv limm.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 23:6-9</char></note> Bo kehm bungu re, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Ntꞌtibi, ntahm nyi Moses nyono ka-r li re, ‘Nne lꞌkpo, nkal ewe sa, eji á ki jel mmon awohng awohng, mmonannyehn nne no ma kpo wo bahke baange nnenkal noo, eji á lꞌjel abon ka mmonannyehn no ma kpo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Jolo abonanyehn nne na asehma. Ngbokambang baange nkal. Mmon awohng awohng á jelem, kehm kpoko. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Etoono kpe baange nnenkal nonehm o. Mmon awohng awohng á jelem, á tob kpo. Ano wo tob jol a mmonannyehn noko no toon-e no. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Erik abonanyehn bako ba sa njahm tob baange nnenkal nonehm o. Mmon awohng awohng bo tikem jel. Bo kpo kpee. Esꞌkohro, nnenkal noo gohro kpo. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Go esꞌkohro efung, ane lꞌfere nyahme go elkv, nne awo bahke jolo nlum a nnenkal noo? Kpee abonanyehn bao na asehma ko nnenkal noo ana nkal abo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Wahn ebsoodo. Ń kpꞌkahne ji wahng kaa? Tibre ń nehme kahn nwer Esowo, ń nehme kahn nsahm nyi Esowo. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Go efung elnyahme ngubjing go elkv, ane bahke fere jol ana babenjel go ejahbetul Esowo. Aneblum nehm kpe ko akal. Anebkal nehm kpe bal alum. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Bade elnyahme ngubjing go elkv, ń ka lung a lung go nwer nyi Moses bade eti ji jo lula? Owo bo nyono re, ‘Esowo bungu tong Moses re, Me wo li Esowo bi Ebraham, a bi Aisik, a bi Jekob.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Jia lohngo re, Ye wo li Esowo bi ane ba li go elkpin, bi akvne sang. Wahn ebsoodo tete.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngbokambang a ntahm nyi ga gbal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ntꞌtibi no atahm awohng jolo o, no jo wuk ana bo jo bung. Á nyehne re, Jisos ebfaange Bab Sadusi nnooba nfaange. Á kehm lohngo ba, ba bahb Jisos re, “Ntahm anyi li li ngbokambang a ntahm nyi gbale sehnge atahm kpee?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jisos kehm faange re, “A wo li ngbokambang a ntahm, ‘Wuken abon Israel! Esowo Ntul ewahre, ye wo li Esowo ntahngtahng. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Nobo re Esowo Ntul ewa jo kor-a eltim eltim ena, a etohko etohko eja, a ntir ntir enya, a eko eko eja.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Etoono ntahm nyehka li re, ‘Nne ebjing ewa jo kor-a ana ebjing eba.’ Ntahm anyehng anyehng go kpeem li, nyi li etahntahn ntahm sehnge nyia na ebal.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:34</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ntꞌtibi no atahm noo kehm bungu tong Jisos re, “Ntꞌtibi, woblohko bung go etingitingi. Etingitingi, lohko li Esowo na abehng. Esowo abehng abehng kpeem li, sehngem ye ntahngtahng wo li no. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ano wo nobo re Esowo jo kor nne eltim eltim ene, a ntir ntir enye, a eko eko eje. Nne ebjing ewe jo kor-e ana ebjing ebe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:12</char></note> Elbumu ni nne bahke jo bum ntahm nyia na ebal, ni ni ga nob sehnge enyam kpee bi á kpo ko, jahm fi ka Esowo, a nsol nyehko nyi á kpo ko lim njom ka Esowo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Eji Jisos kahne re, yebfaange nnooba nfaange, á kehm-e tongo re, “Ebsa ntiil, a li etul bi Esowo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 26:28</char></note> Nnene kpeem sahb, bahb Jisos mbahbe anyehng anyehng.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbahbe nyi li bade Mesaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Eji Jisos jo tib go etahk Esowo, á kehm bahbe mbahbe anyehng re, “Jen ji wahnge atꞌtibi ba atahm kpo bung re, Mesaya bahke lohngo go etꞌtohngo ji Devid? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Yefono Devid nyono ana Etingi Etohko tong-e no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“ ‘Esowo bungu tong ntul ewame re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Ji go egame eboblum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">tete me n lim anebekv eba etikunakpade eja.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Yefono Devid jo lung-e re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:37">‘Ntul ewame’.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:37">Bahke jolo renan, ntul noo kehm fere jol mmon ewe?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 2:29-35</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ellong ane bao wuku alum nyao go eyebatahng.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kake erehke bade atꞌtibi ba atahm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Jisos kehm kpe tib ane re, “Gberen atꞌtibi ba atahm! Kpo kor bo re bo jo kak akpawobo, jo yannge. Go are, bo kpo seb re, ane jo gong, kak bo nnyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Go ero, bo kpo ji go mbuksong. Go elkak, bo kpo ji adi nji nya fuumu re ajꞌjok ane ji. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bo kpo nehm akalebun, taare ntahk ebo. Bo kpo kak alaabe aro go nnyo a nnyo, go ntim kpehme rehng. Elam ji bo bahke bibi sehng.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 2:1-3; 2 Tim 3:1-9; Jud 3-19</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayare nya nkalebun ka no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Eji Jisos ji ona ekpꞌkpa Esowo kohlo edi ji bo kpo ka ayare, á jo nyehne ana bo kpi ayare ka. Afang ane tvv jo ba yaange na yaange akpohko ka. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Nkpak a nkalebun kehm bake, ba tub ederi ebbal kak, bi limi mpene anyehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 8:12; 9:7</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Jisos kehm lungu abatꞌtoono ebe tv elne, kehm tongo bo re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nkalebun noa ana, ye wo ga ka sehnge ane bao kpee. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Egom jehko jo ka gbalee, jo sa bo gbalee go. Ye ji li nkpak, á ka kpee ji á bele no, ji kehn á jol ma ko, gunu nsol alehke.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos bungu bade ana etahk Esowo jio bahke rannge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Jisos lohngo kan a ekpꞌkpa Esowo me, ntꞌtoono ewe na awohng kehme tongo re, “Ntꞌtibi, nyehn elkohn anoobo ntahk nya li gae! Nyehn agburu atal nya bo ko sie!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Wobnyehn ajꞌjok ntahk nyaa? Jol eltal anehng anehng limm, ni bahke kpe kuumu a ntem. Bo bahke wake kpee, wohng ndi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erem, a afemfem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Eji Jisos ji go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Oliv, etahk Esowo jolo go ege a mbuksong kpidi kpidi, Pita, Jems, Jon, a Andru, bo jo jolo a ne o kehm-e bahbe re, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tong-r ngare nyi afemfem nyaa bahke limi. Tib-r elliingi ni bahke jolo, nsol nyio kpee kehm limi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jisos kehm kehme eltibi bo re, “Kunen ekpu, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌki-n nehm. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Ane tvv bahke bake go egama mbing re, bo ba li ntꞌtahre. Bo bahke nehme ane tvv.<verse eid="MRK 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />“Ń lꞌwuk bade ebta bi li kpidi kpidi, fere wuk aka nta fee, kana jo fahl mbol mbol! Elkohn nsol nyia bahke tiki lim. Jol nyaa ana lohngem re, esꞌkohro efung bi ma rehng na. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ajahbe nyandiki bahke jo nok atemtem. Ajahbe nyandiki bahke kehme elnoko a ajahbe nyako. Ndi bahke jo gbꞌgbehke adi nyandiki. Owo njal bahke bake. Nyaa a kpee nya li mbomannahb erem.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Baaben elnahne! Ane bahk-n jo bob, kak esub. Bo bahke jo dv-n dv go ntahk ero. Ḿ bahke jo yiimi go esamahr atubesi, a esamahr atul tib go egame esi, eji ń lꞌjo yiimi ntianse nyi nnoobo etib tong bo.<verse eid="MRK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />“Alum enyame bahke tohko gbo mbang yeere rehng ejang njini abehng abehng. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Bo lꞌbob-n, kak go esub, kana jo tiiri nsol nyi ḿ bahke bungu. Ngare nyio ellum anehng anehng ni Esowo lꞌfere ka-n, bungen! Tibre alum nya ḿ bahke bungu, nyanyahne sang, bahke jo lohng goji Etingi Etohko.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />“Ane bahke kehme abonanyehn jabbe ka re bo wul. Babnde nne bahke tob lim abon ebo ano. Abon bahke tob ten babnde ebo, fere jabbe bo ka re bo wul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 10:17-22; 2 Tim 3:1-5</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Nne awohng awohng bahke jo ko-n ekv tib go egama mbing. Nne awohng awohng no lꞌsoro asi ano go mbang nyi Esowo tete rehng go esꞌkohro, ye wo bahke bele eltahre.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ejum ji kpꞌsahb sꞌsab</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Ḿ bahke nyehne ‘ejum ji kpꞌsahb sꞌsab’, ji bahke rannge edi, yim no edi ji ki fuumu re yiimi. Wuungen atung, wahn kahn nob nob ana lohngo no. Ngare nyio ane ba li go Judea bahke beke, tahm go awong. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Nne no lꞌkuumu go ege ero etahk, jo re ekv, á lꞌbadde, á kꞌtohko seb elyele go ekpꞌkpa song rod ejum fili. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Nne no lꞌjol go ege egbe, á kꞌkpe tohko be na tahm go etahk, song rod abomo enye. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ngare nyio bahke sabe area ka anebkal ba li ela, a anebkal ba kpi abon go ebo.<verse eid="MRK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />“Kaken ero ka Esowo, eji nfem nyio lꞌkꞌlim ngara nnale. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ngare nyio erem bahke gbale sehng, jol bi kala jꞌjol bomo eji Esowo limi njini tete rehng anv. Jol erem ana bio nehm kpe tiki jol ejolojolo.<verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />“Tohko jol re Jehova tele afung nyao kahbe, nne awohng awohng nehm jol no bahke bele eltahre. Tib go esi ane ba Esowo ma yehke, ji ji bahke wahnge Esowo tele afung nyao kahbe.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Ngare nyio nne lꞌtong-n re, ‘Nyehnen Kraist ga!’ afi á tong-n re, ‘Nyehnen Kraist go!’ kana taame tv-e! <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Akimfahnge ane bahke lohngo ba, jo ba bung re, bo ba li Mesaya. Egom jindiki bahke jo bung re, bo ba li abanyehnamahr Esowo. Bo bahke kehme nliingi tib, fere jo lim akpokosi, eji limi limi kan, bo lꞌnehm aneb Esowo, ba Esowo ma jak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 13:13; 2 Tes 2:9</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Kunen ekpu, m ma-n tong jia ana ngare kehm rehnge.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elbake ni Mmon no nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Ngare nyio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">“ ‘Njul bahke dvvrv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">Ebareka nehm kpe ya na eyakeyake.<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Alonlo bahke kehm elfooro go elbung gbo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">Atahm nya elbung bahke range.’<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“Owo bo bahke nyehne Mmon no nne kpꞌbake go akparesemsem, a egburu nsahm enye, a ellub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 1:11</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Owo á bahke tumu enjel enye re bo song ko ane ba Esowo ma jak bo go nkpohka njini anyehng anyehng ba a bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 13:49</char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ejum akpili bade efig</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Kpilen ejum go eti ji bo kpo lung re efig.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 13:6</char></note> Ngare nyi eti jio ma nyono, kak anyane, owo ḿ bahke kahne re, nnale ebba. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Tob li ka-n fvfo. Ń lꞌnyehn nsol nyio kpꞌlimi, kahnen re, elbake ni Mmon no nne ebkabbe. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Ane bao ba bahke jolo go elkpin ngare nyio, bo nehm kpo tete nsol nyio lim kpee.<verse eid="MRK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />“Elbung abola ndi bahke tane, alum enyame nehm tiki tan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:23</char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnene limm, no kpꞌkahne ngare nyio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Efung bio, a ngare nyio, nnene nehme kahn, jol babenjel ba li go ejahbetul Esowo nehme kan, jol Mmon fvfo nehm tob kahn. Nsoo ntahngtahng wo kpꞌkahne.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />“Jo kunen ekpu! Kana tiki lal! Tibre ń nehme kahn ngare nyi nsol nyio bahke limi.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />“Bahke jolo ana nne kpꞌtahme edi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 25:14</char></note> Re á tahm etahk eje sa, á bahke tohko rod alokeltum ebe bum o, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌjo lim eltum ene. Á bahke tongo mbꞌbaabe re á jo baabe mbutahk. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Kunen ekpu, tibre ń nehme kahn ngare nyi nfontahk bahke kehnge. Á li ma ba elgung, á li ma ba nlum atv, á li ma ba ngare nyi ekok kpꞌkuku. Á li ma ba efungfu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:38</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kana jo lal, eji afi nfontahk gbede na ba, á lꞌki-n ba kpiri, ń kpꞌlale. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ji m bungu a, tong-n li ka wahn ane kpee re wahn jo baabe.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ana bo toobo re bo bahke wulu Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ngare nyio ebsa nfung ebal elkak Pasova kehm rehnge, nio ni abred nya bo kil jo kak ayist. Atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm jo sebe mbang ana nyi bo bahke bobo Jisos mbehr mbehr song wul. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Bo kehm bungu re, “E nehm lim ngare elkak, eji ntong lꞌkꞌgbo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo wohngo Jisos akehng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jon 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Jisos kehm feere je go Betani go etahk Saimon ji jolo nne abili wuku wuku. Eji bo jo li nsol, nnenkal awohng kehm bake, ba yel ekpꞌkpa. Á fili elom akehng ji nno a nno, ji sahb kꞌkim ekun. Á kehm lennge elom akehng jio, yaange akehng kak Jisos go esi.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ane bandiki ba jolo ona kehm kehme atahng rak, fere jo bung atemtem re, “Jen ji wahng ka á kpꞌfade akehng ana maa! <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Kehn bo jol gungu, ko mpon atahl asehma, ko akpohko nyao, le akpak.” Eltim kehm rake bo tob nnenkal noo.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “Yaken ye! Jen ji wahnge ń kp-e gbiingi? Yeblim nnobonobo ejum ka-m. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Wahn, ngare anyehng anyehng akpak li a nahne. Lꞌfere kor-n, ḿ bahke ma jo lim nnoobo ka bo. Me n nehm jol a nahne ngare kpe kpe. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Nnenkal noa eblim ji á male no. Á toobo ebjing ebame bum, bi m bahke kpoko. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Edi ajehng ajehng go njini ji bo bahke tiingi nnoobo etib, bo bahke jo tob bung bade jia ji nnenkal noa ma lim, eji bo lꞌjo buum-e.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:26</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Judas Iskariot taame re, á bahke jabbe Jisos, kak abi ane go ebo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Judas Iskariot ji woomo go ellong ewubu ane abal ba jo toono Jisos kehm tahme goji atubesi abalimajom re á song gungu Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Eltim yebe bo sehng, eji bo wuku ji Judas jo bung. Bo kehm taame re bo bahk-e kake akpohko. Á kehm kehme elsebe mbang nyi nno nyi á bahke jabbe Jisos kak bo go abo.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos li elkak Pasova, a abatꞌtoono ebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ngbokambang efung elkak ni abred nya bo kil jo kak ayist, ni ni jolo efung bi bo wulu abon ejoro. Abatꞌtoono Jisos kehm bahbe Jisos re, “Gan wo a kpꞌsebe re wahr song toobo nsol alehke elkak bum-a?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Jisos kehm tumu ane abal, fere tong bo re, “Songen go nfam. Ḿ bahke wane nne no solo etulahb. Toonen ye, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />wahn song go etahk ji á bahke yange. Tongen nfontahk noo re, ‘Ntꞌtibi ewahre re, Ekpꞌkpa jin ji á bahke jehke, a abatꞌtoono ebe, li elkak nia?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Á bahk-n tibi ekpꞌkpa ji li go ero enyong, ji bo ma jehke nsol kpee. Owo ḿ bahke toobo nsol nyio bum-r.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm tahme song rehng go nfam, lohko song nyehn nsol kpee, nyi Jisos tongo bo. Bo kehm toobo nsol elkak nyio bum.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Elgung ba kan a me, Jisos kehm tahme, a abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu ane abal. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Eji bo jehk go ekpꞌkuru kpꞌlehke nsol, Jisos kehm bungu re, “Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, Nne awohng ewahne no kpꞌlehke nsol a name bahk-m jabbe, kak abi ane go ebo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Abatꞌtoono ebe, ndon kehm kehme bo fili. No nne jo bahbe Jisos re, “Me woa, afi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jisos kehm faange bo re, “Bahke jolo nne awohng go egahne ellong no kpꞌtohko ebred ekpingi ajehng a name. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Mmon no nne bahke kpoko ana nwer Esowo bungu no. Erem bahke gbale sehng ka nne no ma gungu Mmon no nne. Jol ga nob, li re, nne noo bo we jelem.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsol alehke nyi elbuumu Ntul a Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Eji bo jo li nsol o, Jisos kehm rodo ebred, kak Esowo saam, kehm bakke ka abatꞌtoono ebe, kehm bungu re, “Koon, wahn li! A wo li ngubjing enyame.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Á kehm rodo nkob, kak Esowo saam, kehm kake bo. Bo kpee kehm woko ona. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Jisos kehm bungu re, “A wo li alung emame ma egbanngalung ji nfenfe, ma kpꞌfabe ka ane gbalee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 8:8-11</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Etingitingi, n kp-n tongo re, N nehm kpe tiki wo alahb avain maa tete go efung bio bi m bahke kpe wo a nahne go ejahbetul Esowo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Owo bo kehm yimi ese ero, kehm soro tahm asongo go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Oliv.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos tongo Pita re Pita bahk-e tene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Jisos kehm bungu tong bo re, “Wahn kpee bahke dulu atv maa tib esi ejame. Tibre nwer Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">“ ‘Esowo bahke wulu mbaabebul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">ebul ebe yaame.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ngare nyi m ma nyahme go elkv, m bahk-n gboko mbang song rehng go Galili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pita kehm faange re, “Me, wa n nehm tiki yake, jol afi egom jehka kpee yaam-a na sa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jisos kehm bungu tong Pita re, “Etingitingi, n kp-a tongo re, Re nkok kehm kuku nkpel ebal, a bahke gbaame nkpel era atv maa re, me a nyimm.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Pita kehm faange tꞌtahne re, “Me, wa n nehm tiki ten, jol afi elkv ni, m bahke tob kpo a na.” Abatꞌtoono bako kehm tob bung ano fvfo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos song kak ero go Gesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Bo kehm song rehng go etahngga ji bo jo lung re Gesemani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 18:1</char></note> Jisos kehm tongo abatꞌtoono ebe re, “Jiin a, me n tohko song kak ero.”<verse eid="MRK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Á kehm rodo Pita, Jems, a Jon, bo tahm. Á kehm kehme elfahle, ala fere jo teel-e. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “Eltim ename ebgbal ndon ndon sehng, jol tete rehng go elkv. Jiin ana, wahn jo baabe!” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Á kehm jeere, je esꞌsong, song gbo noongo ndi. Á kehm kehme ero kak re, “Nsoo, nong, me n kꞌlub nyehn erem bia, eyake lꞌfere jol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:27</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Nsoo, ejum ajehng ajehng riidem go ega. Fak-m erem bia! Ana koro me sang, ana koro wo wo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Á kehm feere, ba kpiri abatꞌtoono ebe, ane ara, á ba no, bo kpꞌlale. Á kehm bungu tong Pita re, “Saimon, a kpꞌlala? A nehm ma ji awa anyehng kꞌlala?”<verse eid="MRK 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Á kehm tongo bo re, “Jo baaben, wahn jo kak ero, eji ń lꞌkꞌyel go elgaare. Etohko, mbang nyi Esowo kp-e kor, wo ga, ngubjing kpꞌleenge.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 7:22-23; Hib 4:15</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Á kehm kpe feere, kpe song kehme ero bꞌnehm kak ana wuku wuku, <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />kehm kpe feere ba goji abatꞌtoono ebe, kpe ba nyehn bo, bo kpꞌlale. Tibre akpakamahr lubu bo ellu ellu. Bo joom kahn ji bo bahk-e tꞌtong.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Á kpe feere kan a me, á kehm ba tong bo re, “Ń kpi nlale nlala? Songen, wahn song re ekv! Ebgbal. Ngare nyi ma biingi a, nyi bo bahke jabbe Mmon no nne, kak abi ane go abo. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mehlen, wahr tahmen! Nyehnen, nne no bahk-m jabbe, kak abi ane go abo yeb rehng a kpidi kpidi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo bobo Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jon 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Eji Jisos kpi mbungu mbungu, Judas ji woomo go ellong ewubu ane abal, ba jo toono Jisos, kehm lohngo ba, a ellong ane ba fili akahngkahng, a atahmtahm. Atubesi abalimajom, atꞌtibi ba atahm, a atubesi nfam ba tumu bo. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Nne no gung-e gungu tongo ane bao re, “Nne no, n lꞌsod-e nnyo, ye wo ń kpe-e sebe. Boben ye, song a ne, wahn baab-e nob nob!”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Judas rehnge kan a me, á kehm jeere rehng goji Jisos, kehm-e lungu re, “Ntꞌtibi!” kehm soro sod-e nnyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Bo kehm tubu Jisos ejahm gꞌgingi.<verse eid="MRK 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Nne awohng no yiimi ona kehm wobo ekahngkahng go mbak, kpale nlokeltum a ntubesi abalimajom awohng etung.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Jisos kehm tongo bo re, “Ń fili akahngkahng, a atahmtahm re wahn ba bob-m ana nwulanea? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Efung abehng abehng n jo jolo a nahne, jo tib-n go etahk Esowo, me ḿ bobem. Tibre alum nya Esowo bungu no bahke tiki lim.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kpee kehm soro yaam-e sa, be ebo tahm.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Njangkun anyehng jolo ona, nyi bobo mbarebara mbomo mi mi. Á jo tob toono Jisos fvfo. Bo gare re bo bob-e. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Á kehm yake mbomo tv bo, kehm beke ngubjing nehme nehme tahm.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yiimi go esamahr elam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Jon 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bo kehm koko Jisos tahm a ne go etahk ntubesi abalimajom. Owo atubesi abalimajom kpee, a anebkul nfam, a atꞌtibi ba atahm kono nkon. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Jisos jo jene ekv. Pita jen ekv. Bo ba rehng go nlaaga ntubesi abalimajom. Owo Pita ji no, a alokeltum nfontahk, jo wooro agun. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Atubesi abalimajom, a atul esub jo sebe mbang ana nyi bo bahke Jisos ebi ka, toono o, bo wul-e. Bo tikem nyehn ebi ajehng ajehng ji Jisos limi no.<verse eid="MRK 14:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Atianse gbalee jo kiimi afahnge lake Jisos. Alum nya bo jo bung joom yel. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Ane bako kehm kpe mehl, kiimi afahnge lak-e re, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“E wuk-e ana á bungu re, á bahke wake etahk Esowo jio ji ane si no, fere tuungu si ji nfenfe o nfung era, ji bo kala sꞌsi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 2:19</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Atianse nya bo jo yiimi, anyo joom yel jang jang.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ntubesi abalimajom kehm mehle yiimi, kehm bahbe Jisos re, “A nehme faanga? A nehme wuk ebi ji atianse nyaa kp-a kaka?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Jisos belle na belle, jol á faangem ellum anehng anehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 8:32</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Ntubesi abalimajom noo kehm-e kpe bahb re, “Wo wo li Mesaya, Mmon no Esowo bi gbale sehnga?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jisos kehm faange re, “Me wo. Ḿ bahke nyehne Mmon no nne jehk go eboblum Esowo bi kpi nsahm. Ḿ bahk-e nyehne ana á kpꞌbake go akparesemsem.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 14:14</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ntubesi abalimajom kehm yare ewobo eje, kehm bungu re, “E nehme kpe seb ntianse anyehng anyehng. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Wahn ebwuk abi alum enye, ana á ma su Esowo. Ń kpꞌtiri renan?” Bo kpee kehm bungu re, “Yebgbo ntahm. Nobo re bo wul-e.”<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Egom jindiki kehme atel so wohngo Jisos. Bo gba-e mbomo go esamahr, kehm-e kehme eldohko. Bo kehm bungu re, “Nyehn-r amahr me!” Alokeltum bao soro kehm-e nkpal ruumu.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pita tene Jisos re, we á nyimm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jon 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ngare nyio Pita kpeke li go nlaaga nyio. Owo nlokeltum a ntubesi abalimajom no jolo nnenkal kehm bake. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Á nyehne kan Pita a me, eji á kpi agun wooro, á kehm-e seenge too, kehm-e tongo re, “Wo fvfo tob jolo a Jisos ji Nasaret.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Á kehm gbaame re, “Me, we n nyimm. N nehme wuk ji a kpꞌbungu.” Á kehm lohngo, song yiimi go mbuga. Nkok kehm soro kuk.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Nlokeltum noo kehm-e kpe nyehn, kehm kpe bung tong ane ba yiimi o re, “Ye wob go bo ellong.”<verse eid="MRK 14:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pita kehm kpe ten. Mmongare ntiil ane ba yiimi o kehm kpe bung tong Pita re, “Go etingitingi, wo wob go bo ellong. A lohng go Galili. Wahr ma-a liingi go ega alum.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Pita kehm tiri re, “Esowo demm-m na demme. Nne no ń kpꞌbungu bada ne, me, we n nyimm.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Nkok kehm soro kpe kuk. Owo Pita kehm soro buumu ellum ni Jisos bungu tong-e re, “Re nkok kehm kuku nkpel ebal, a bahk-m tene nkpel era.” Á kehm kehme ellingi ndon ndon.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos yiimi go esamahr Pailet, nne a Rom no jo fili Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jon 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Etoono efungfu behko atubesi abalimajom, atꞌtibi ba atahm, anebkul nfam, a atul bako ba esub kehm toobo ana bo bahke limi. Bo kehm kake Jisos agbekobo, kehm-e rodo, tahm a ne, song kak Pailet go ebo.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pailet kehm-e bahbe re, “Wo wo li ntul no Jusa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jisos kehm taame re, “Ee, me wo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Atubesi abalimajom bao ona kehm kehme eltooro nsol gbalee, fere jo ka-e ebi.<verse eid="MRK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pailet kehm kpe bahb Jisos re, “A nehm faanga? A nehme wuk ebi ji bo kp-a kaka?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Jisos kpeem faange ejumjum. Pailet kehm-e kpoko esi area.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elam ji bo kimi re bo wul Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ngare elkak (Pasova) anyehng anyehng Pailet jo yehke nne a ngbekobo awohng yake, no bo lꞌseb. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ngare nyio ona nne awohng woomo go ngbekobo, no bo jo lung-e re Barabas, budu ate ebe ba jo wul ane, eji bo jo jokko ejahbe. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Eji ellong ane kame no ba rur, bo kehm tongo Pailet re, á yehke nne awohng. Ano wo eljini ene jolo no, ni á jo kono ellimi.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pailet kehm bahbe bo re, “Ń kpꞌsebe re me n yehke ntul no Jus ka-na?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Á jo kahne re, atubesi abalimajom ebyake Jisos ka-e, tib eji á jo teele bo ala. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Atubesi abalimajom kehm nyare ellong ane bao, eji bo lꞌgbiingi Pailet, á yehke Barabas yake, fere wul Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pailet kehm kpe bung tong ellong ane bao re, “Jen ji ń kpꞌsebe re me n lim nne noa no ń kp-e lungu re ntul no Jus?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bo kehm rabe re, “Kum-e go ekros!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pailet kehm bahbe re, “Anv, jen ji á ma lꞌlim?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Bo kehm kpe rabe tiim re, “Kum-e go ekros!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pailet jo sebe re, ellong ane bao bel eyebatahng, owo á kehm yehke Barabas yake, yake Jisos ka, bo dv-e. Bo dv-e kan a me, Pailet rod-e, kak nsoja go abo re bo song kum-e go ekros.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo nyoko Jisos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jon 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Nsoja nyio kehm rodo Jisos, yange a ne go nlaaga ntubesi ejahbe. Bo kehm lungu ellong nsoja nehko re bo ba. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bo kehm kake Jisos mbilibili ekpawobo ana ji atul jo kono elkake, kehm tahnge ekpasi akpiri, ba konng-e go esi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Bo kehm-e kehme nnyo mia kak re, “Wo noaa, ntul ewahra?” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bo kehm koko ebti, jo rum-e go esi, kehm kehme atel so wohng-e, jo gbo jamm-e alahng, are bo kp-e kake na.<verse eid="MRK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Bo nohk-e kan a rahke, bo kehm-e yehke ekpawobo jio, kehm feere a nsol enye kak-e, tahm a ne re bo song kum-e go ekros.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo kumu Jisos go ekros</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Eji bo fi mbang mbang, bo kehm nyehne nne no bo jo lung-e re Saimon ji lohng mmojahbe noko kpꞌbake go Jeusalem. Bo kehm-e bobo re á sol ekros ji Jisos. Saimon jolo nne a Sirin, ye wo jele Aleksanda, a Rufus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 16:13</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bo kehm koko Jisos tahm a ne go edi ji bo jo lung re Golgota, ji lohngo re Edi Nkpakesi. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Owo bo gare re bo ka-e amahm semme anyane nya bo kpo lung re mmir. Jisos tikem wo. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Bo kehm-e kumu go ekros, rod abomo enye bum, fere tub elfaange re bo kahn ana nne awohng awohng bahke koko.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Jolo nkaranka esehmwubu nyi efungfu nyi bo kum-e go ekros. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ejum ji wahng ka bo kum-e lake go ekros, ji ji bo nyono go ekros re, “A wo li ntul no Jus.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bo tob kumu awulane, ane abal lake ona, noko, bo kum-e go ege ejang eboblum, noko go ege ejang ebobkal. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ana wo li ellum ni nnyehnamahr Esowo bungu no go nkꞌkula ngare re, “Bo bahk-e fange kak go ellong abi ane.” Ni ni a, ma lohko jol.<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Ane ba jo sehng mbang jo tiib-e abo, fere jo su-e re, “A tongo re, a bahke wake etahk Esowo, fere tuungu si ji nfenfe go nfung era. <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Tahre elna, wo badde go ekros me!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 4:23</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Atubesi abalimajom, a atꞌtibi ba atahm jo tꞌtob nyok-e fvfo, fere jo bung atemtem re, “Á kpo tahre ane bako. Yefono nehm ma tahre elne. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Nong, wahr nyehn ana Kraist, ntul no Israel, bahke badde go ekros ba, eji e lꞌtaame tv-e.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 16:1,4</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Ane ba, bo tob kum bo go akros fvfo jo tꞌtob su Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpo no</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Eji efin ma yiimi, ejannge kehm gboko go ejahbe jio kpee, ji tete biingi awa na ara.<verse eid="MRK 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Nkaranka era nyi elgung Jisos kehm rabe wꞌwahre wꞌwahre re, “Eloi eloi lama sabaktani!” ji lohngo re, “Nsoo, nsoo, jen ji wahng ka a ma-m yake anae?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Eji egom ane bandiki ba jolo ona wuku alum nya Jisos bungu no, bo kehm bungu re, “Wuken, á kpi Elaija lung.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Nne awohng kehm beke song ko ndꞌdahng, suku go amahm, tung go esi ebti, kehm tabe ton Jisos go ege a nnyo re á yab. Á kehm bungu re, “Nong, wahr tohko nyꞌnyehn, joare Elaija bahke bake, ba fon-e go ekros.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Jisos kehm soro rabe, soro kpo.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ekpiki ji bo tohko go etahk Esowo kehm soro yang, bomo ero tete ba jahm ndi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 6:19; 10:20</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Eji ntubesi a nsoja no yiimi ona wane go ekros nyehne ana Jisos kpo no, á kehm bungu re, “Nne noa ana lohko jol Mmon Esowo!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Anebkal bako jolo ona, ba yiimi go fee, jo nyehn, Salome a Meri ji lohng go Magdala, go Meri nnyehn a Joses abola Jems, ji jolo mmonse. Bo tob woomo go ellong nio. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bo jo toono Jisos ngare nyi á jolo go Galili, fere jo kak-e ebo. Ellong anebkal bako ba tob toono Jisos ba go Jeusalem fvfo, tob jolo o.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana bo kake Jisos go elahm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Efung bi bo kpo toobo ebjing bi elkak Pasova, bi sene efung Esabat, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />owo Josef ji lohng go Arimatia kehm bake. Á jolo nlamalam no jo sahb lꞌlub ane. Á jo siki elbake nio ni etul bi Esowo. Josef jo sahb tahm song kpiri ntul a Pailet, kehm-e bahbe re á lub taame, á song fono ekv ji Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 15:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pailet kehm-e sahb kpꞌkpo esi, eji á wuku re, Jisos ebtahr kpꞌkpo. Á kehm lungu ntubesi a nsoja, kehm-e bahbe, joare yebtahr kpꞌkpo. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Eji Pailet wuku goji ntubesi a nsoja noo re, yeblohko kpo, á kehm tongo Josef re, á song fono ekv ji Jisos, song a ji.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Josef kehm gunu mbarebara mbomo, kehm song fono ekv ji Jisos, fere kpennge mbomo mio, rod tahm a ji, song kak go elahm bi bo rahme go ekpartal. Á kehm bannge eltal, bulu go nnyo elahm.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Meri ji lohng go Magdala, abola Meri nnyehn Joses, bo jo kpuru re bo nyehn edi ji bo kake Jisos.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos nyahme go elkv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Eji efung Esabat ma sehng, Meri ji lohng go Magdala, a Salome, go Meri nnyehn Jems, bo song gunu ajoobo akehng re bo song taame ekv ji Jisos. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ngbokambang efung go erahde, efungfu atv atv, bo kehm tahme go elahm ngare nyi njul ma ta elbange. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bo kehm kehme elbungu atemtem re, “Anv, nne awo bahke bannge eltal nio go nnyo elahm ka-r me?”<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Jolo egburu eltal ni nnen a nnen. Eji bo rehnge go elahm, bo kehm tabe asamahr ebo, soro nyehn eltal nio ma bannge, noongo go nkpe. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Bo kehm soro yel go elahm. Owo bo nyehne njangkun jehk go ejang eboblum, nyi kake mbarebare ekpawobo. Bo kehm kehme elfahle.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Njangkun nyio tongo bo re, “Kana kpe fahl! Ń kpi Jisos ji Nasaret seb, ye ji bo kum-e go ekros. Ana á limm. Yebnyahme fi. A wo bo bum-e no. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Songen anv, wahn song tong Pita, a abatꞌtoono Jisos bako fvfo re, Jisos bahk-n gboko mbang song rehng go Galili. Go wo ḿ bahk-e nyehne, ana á tong-n no.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Owo bo kehm soro lohng go elahm, be asongo. Tibre ala jo tꞌteele bo, akahb fere jo kahm bo. Bo tikem bung ejumjum, tong nne awohng awohng. Tibre bo jo fꞌfahl.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpiri Meri ji lohng go Magdala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Jon 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Eji Jisos nyahme go elkv, á nyahme ngbokambang efung go erahde nkpese efungfu. Á gbo mbang kpiri Meri ji lohng go Magdala, ye ji á kam-e abi atohko na asehma yehke. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Meri kehm tahme song tong ane bao ba jo toono Jisos, ba ji ndon ndon, fere jo ling.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:3-8</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Eji bo wuku re, Jisos noa go elkpin, Meri m-e nyehn, bo tikem taame tv-e.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpiri abatꞌtoono ebe, ane abal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Fvfo, Jisos kehm tob kpiri abatꞌtoono ebe, ane abal, go elfoongo nne nondiki eji bo ma lohng go Jeusalem kpꞌtahme ejahbe jehko. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bo kehm feere ba tong abatꞌtoono baka, jol bo tikem taame tv bo.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos kpiri abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu a nne awohng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Elt 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Esꞌkohro, Jisos kehm ba kpiri abatꞌtoono ebe, ewubu a nne awohng, eji bo kpi nsol li. Á kehm nyame bo tib go bo ekꞌtaame, a etahnsi ebo. Tibre bo tikem taame tv ane bao ba nyehn-e no, fere ba tong bo re, yebnyahme go elkv, fere jol go elkpin.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Á kehm bungu tong bo re, “Songen go njini kpee, wahn song bung alum Esowo tong nne awohng awohng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 5:28; Rom 15:19</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Nne no lꞌtaame, fere bel ewohngalahb, á bahke bele eltahre. Nne no tohko fere taame, á bahke lehke ebi. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ane ba lꞌtaame, bo bahke bele nsahm nyi bo bahke jo lim akpokosi. Bo bahke jo kam ane abi atohko yehke go egama mbing. Bo bahke jo bung go ajahbe nfenfe. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Bo lꞌrod enyo go abo, fere wo ebi ekahm, ejumjum nehm lim bo. Bo bahke jo kunu aneb ayam abo, bo nob.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Jisos tahme go ejahbetul Esowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Elt 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Eji Ntul a Jisos ma bung a bo mal, nsahm Esowo kehm-e soro rod, tahm a ne go ejahbetul Esowo. Jisos song ji go eboblum Esowo. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Abatꞌtoono ebe kehm tahme, jo bung alum Esowo edi ajehng ajehng. Jehova jo kake bo ebo, fere jo yiimi ntianse ka alum enye nya bo jo bung, eji bo jo lim akpokosi nya á ka bo re bo lim.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>